const TEXTS = {"VermilionCity_House2_Text_ThankYou":"Thank you!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyPostBattle":"ZUBAT is tough!\\nBut if you can catch one, you'll\\lbe able to count on it.$","CeruleanCity_House5_Text_ExchangeWithWhat":"With what would you like to \\nexchange it?$","Trade_Text_ThatsTooBad":"That's too bad.$","DiglettsCave_NorthEntrance_RockTunnelPitchBlack":"I went inside ROCK TUNNEL, but it's\\npitch-black and scary in there.\\pIf I could get a POKéMON to use\\nFLASH and light it up…$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_PeelSpudsEveryDay":"Hum-de-hum-de-ho…\\pI peel spuds every day!\\nHum-hum…$","SafariZone_West_Text_RestHouse":"REST HOUSE$","Route25_Text_AreYouHereAlone":"Hello, are you here alone?\\pIf you're out at CERULEAN's cape…\\nWell, it should be as a couple.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveSomethingForMe":"OAK: Oh, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is my old POKéMON?\\pWell, it seems to be growing more\\nattached to you.\\pYou must be talented as a POKéMON\\nTRAINER.\\pWhat's that?\\nYou have something for me?$","Text_Cup":"It's a cup with a POKéMON mark\\non it.$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_ComeSeeMeInAWhile":"Come see me in a while.$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_WowYourBikeIsCool":"Wow.\\nYour BIKE is really cool!$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_ExplainItemfinder":"There are items on the ground that\\nmay be hidden from view.\\pUse the ITEMFINDER to detect any\\nhidden items close to you.\\pThe machine is a bit limited.\\nIt can't pinpoint item locations.\\pWhat it does is show the direction\\nwhere the item is.\\pUse it to get your bearings, then\\nsearch the suspect area by hand.$","Route3_Text_CalvinRematchIntro":"Hey! What's wrong with you?\\nYou're still not wearing shorts!$","Route6_NorthEntrance_Text_ThirstyOnGuardDuty":"I'm on guard duty.\\nGee, I'm thirsty, though!\\pOh, wait there, the road's closed.$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_BillsFavoriteMonList":"BILL's favorite POKéMON list!$","Trade_Text_IsntMyOldMonGreat":"Isn't my old {STR_VAR_2} great?$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyDefeat":"Fried!$","PalletTown_Text_HmmIsThatRight":"Hmm…\\nIs that right…$","Trade_Text_WhatThatsNoMon":"What?\\nThat's no {STR_VAR_1}!$","Route4_Text_CrissyRematchIntro":"I always catch mushroom POKéMON\\non MT. MOON.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CantGroomAnEgg":"Oh, sorry. I honestly can't\\ngroom an EGG.$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_BrooksIntro":"Competing against the young keeps\\nme youthful.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalTellSisNotToGiveYouMap":"{PLAYER}, I hate to say it, but you\\nwon't be necessary for this.\\pI know! I'll borrow a TOWN MAP\\nfrom my sis!\\pI'll tell her not to lend you one,\\n{PLAYER}! Hahaha!\\pDon't bother coming around to\\nmy place after this!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_HeyDontLookAtMyNotes":"GIRL: Hey!\\nDon't look at my notes!$","CableClub_Text_CantDoubleBattleWithXPlayers":"The DOUBLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ReceivedSSTicketFromBill":"{PLAYER} received an S.S. TICKET\\nfrom BILL.$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_DawnDefeat":"Take it easy!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoChoosePlayer":"{RIVAL}: Heh, I don't need to be\\ngreedy like you. I'm mature!\\pGo ahead and choose, {PLAYER}!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_SaveOptionInMenu":"The SAVE option is on the MENU.\\nUse it regularly.$","Route25_Text_FranklinPostBattle":"Drat!\\nA ZUBAT bit me back in that cave.$","Route3_Text_RobinRematchIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you push me?$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyPostBattle":"I lost some of my allowance…$","Text_ProfileSaysSomethingAboutYou":"Hmhm…\\pYour profile really says something\\nabout who you are.\\pNow that I know you better, it \\nmakes us better friends than ever!$","Text_BeautifulSkyWindow":"Outside the window…\\pThe sky looks fantastically\\nbeautiful.$","ViridianCity_House_Text_SpearowNameSpeary":"SPEAROW\\nName: SPEARY$","Route3_Text_JanicePostBattle":"You shouldn't be staring if you\\ndon't want to battle!$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TeamRocketAttacksCerulean":"TEAM ROCKET attacks CERULEAN\\ncitizens…\\pNot a day goes by without TEAM\\nROCKET being in the news.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"VERMILION POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: LT. SURGE\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXImpressiveFollowMe":"You've caught… {STR_VAR_2}!?\\nNow, this is impressive!\\pThere's something I wanted to ask\\nof you, {PLAYER}.\\pCome.\\nFollow me.$","Route24_Text_CaleRematchIntro":"People call this the NUGGET\\nBRIDGE!\\pYou've already beaten us, so you're\\nnot allowed to take the challenge…\\p…But, you're welcome to battle with\\nus again.$","Text_PokecenterSign":"Heal Your POKéMON!\\nPOKéMON CENTER$","CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TryTradingUpstairs":"Why don't you go upstairs and try\\ntrading POKéMON with your friends?\\pYou could get a lot more variety\\nby trading.\\pThe POKéMON you get in trades grow\\nquickly, too.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain":"That's fine, then.\\nI'll hope to see you back again.$","VermilionCity_Text_BoardSeagallopRainbowPass":"Ah, you have a RAINBOW PASS.\\pWould you like to board\\na SEAGALLOP ferry?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLetsCheckOutMons":"{RIVAL}: Wait, {PLAYER}!\\nLet's check out our POKéMON!\\pCome on, I'll take you on!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"Press START to open the MENU!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ThoseArePokeBalls":"Those are POKé BALLS.\\nThey contain POKéMON!$","VermilionCity_House3_Text_Pidgey":"PIDGEY: Kurukkoo!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerPostBattle":"It's not easy opening that door.\\pLT. SURGE was always famous for\\nhis cautious nature in the Army.$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_ShipDepartingSoon":"The party's over.\\nThe ship will be departing soon.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiIntro":"Heh!\\nYou must be running out of steam\\lby now!$","VermilionCity_Text_Machop":"MACHOP: Guoh! Gogogoh!$","SSAnne_1F_Room5_Text_ArthurPostBattle":"I wish to be left alone!\\nGet out!$","OneIsland_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsualPCServicesUnavailable":"The usual PC services aren't\\navailable…$","VermilionCity_Text_Seagallop12Departing":"Okay, everything's in order for you\\nto board a special ferry.\\pSEAGALLOP HI-SPEED 12 will be\\ndeparting immediately.$","ViridianCity_Text_GymSign":"VIRIDIAN CITY POKéMON GYM$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenuCopy":"TRAINER TIPS!\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsAuthorityOnMons":"PROF. OAK may not look like much,\\nbut he's the authority on POKéMON.\\pMany POKéMON TRAINERS hold him in\\nhigh regard.$","Route21_North_Text_LilIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","Route6_Text_JeffRematchIntro":"Huh?\\nYou want to go with me again?$","ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty":"I absolutely forbid you from\\ngoing through here!\\pThis is private property!$","Route24_Text_ShanePostBattle":"I hid because the people on the\\nbridge frightened me.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVFourBoysOnRailroad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nFour boys are walking on railroad\\ltracks.\\p…I better go, too.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_StudyAsOaksAide":"I study POKéMON as PROF. OAK's\\nAIDE.$","Text_TakeYourPkmnForFewSeconds":"Okay, I'll take your POKéMON for a\\nfew seconds.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeIntro":"Your POKéMON will cower at the\\ncrack of my whip!$","Route22_Text_LeagueGateSign":"POKéMON LEAGUE\\nFront Gate$","Route11_Text_DillonIntro":"I just became a TRAINER.\\nBut, I think I can win.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeRematchIntro":"I got a big haul again!\\nWanna go for it once more?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PlayersPokedexWasUpgraded":"{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX was upgraded!$","Route25_Text_FlintPostBattle":"Oh, well.\\nMy girlfriend will cheer me up.$","Route24_Text_TimmyDefeat":"Ow!\\nStomped flat!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PikachuTwiceAsCute":"Humph!\\pMy PIKACHU is twice as cute as\\nthat one!$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerRematchIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","Text_DreamEaterTeach":"Yawn!\\nI must have dozed off in the sun.\\pI had this weird dream about\\na DROWZEE eating my dream.\\pAnd…\\nI learned how to eat dreams…\\pOogh, this is too spooky!\\pLet me teach it to a POKéMON so\\nI can forget about it!$","Route3_Text_JaniceIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou looked at me, didn't you?$","ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle":"CATERPIE has no poison,\\nbut WEEDLE does.\\pWatch that your POKéMON aren't\\nstabbed by WEEDLE's POISON STING.$","Text_DreamEaterDeclined":"…Snore…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNeedYourHelpTooNeedToSeePokedexes":"OAK: I know, I know.\\nOf course I need your help, too.\\pNow, I need to see both your\\nPOKéDEXES.$","SSAnne_1F_Room3_Text_Wigglytuff":"WIGGLYTUFF: Puup pupuu!$","Route25_Text_NobRematchIntro":"A POKéMANIAC lives on the cape.\\nHave you seen his collection?$","SSAnne_2F_Corridor_Text_RivalPostBattle":"{RIVAL}: I heard there was a CUT\\nmaster on board.\\pBut he was just a seasick old man!\\pCUT itself is really useful.\\nYup, it'll be handy.\\pYou should go see him, too.\\nSmell ya!$","Route25_Text_DanRematchIntro":"Dad took me to a great party on\\nthe S.S. ANNE at VERMILION CITY.$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_IAmLeChefMainCourseIs":"Er-hem!\\nIndeed I am le CHEF!\\pLe main course is$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FeelFreeToUsePC":"Please feel free to use that PC in\\nthe corner.\\pThe receptionist told me so.\\nIt's so kind of her!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshIntro":"Did you come to explore the cave,\\ntoo?$","Route24_Text_YouDontHaveAnyRoom":"You don't have any room!$","Text_ATownMap":"A TOWN MAP.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ReceivedHM05FromAide":"{PLAYER} received HM05\\nfrom the AIDE.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_DidntComeToSeeAboutMonsAgain":"Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pDid you come see me about my\\nPOKéMON again?\\pNo?\\nToo bad!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainBikeVoucher":"Take that BIKE VOUCHER to the\\nBIKE SHOP in CERULEAN CITY.\\pExchange that for a BICYCLE\\nfree of charge!\\pDon't worry, my favorite FEAROW\\nwill FLY me anywhere I need to go.\\pSo, I have no need for a BICYCLE.\\pI hope you like cycling!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_ComeAgain":"Come again.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou":"Wait!\\nTake this with you.$","Route11_Text_HugoPostBattle":"POKéMON is life!\\nAnd to live is to play games!$","Route25_Text_FlintDefeat":"Aww, darn…$","ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest":"LEAVING VIRIDIAN FOREST\\nPEWTER CITY AHEAD$","Route5_SouthEntrance_Text_HiHowsItGoing":"Hi, how's it going?$","ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned":"VIRIDIAN GYM's LEADER returned!$","Text_FoundOneItem":"{PLAYER} found one {STR_VAR_2}!$","SSAnne_2F_Corridor_Text_ThisShipIsLuxuryLiner":"This ship, she is a luxury liner for\\nTRAINERS of the world!\\pAt every port, we hold parties with\\ninvited TRAINERS.$","Text_ObtainedTheX":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalDefeat":"WHAT?\\nUnbelievable!\\lI picked the wrong POKéMON!$","SSAnne_1F_Room5_Text_ArthurDefeat":"Humph! You rude child!\\nYou have no sense of courtesy!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_SpStatsWaterfall":"The SP. ATK and SP. DEF stats of\\nall your POKéMON rise a little bit.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nWATERFALL outside of battle.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCanReachNextTownWithMon":"OAK: If a wild POKéMON appears,\\nyour POKéMON can battle it.\\pWith it at your side, you should be\\nable to reach the next town.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PikachuSoonIPromise":"Yeah, a PIKACHU soon, I promise!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Pikachu":"PIKACHU: Chu! Pikachu!$","Route6_Text_KeigoDefeat":"No!\\nYou're kidding!$","CeruleanCity_House2_Text_RocketsStoleTMForDig":"Those miserable ROCKETS!\\pLook what they've done to my\\nhouse!\\pThey stole a TM for teaching\\nPOKéMON how to DIG holes!\\pI was going to use it on a\\nMANKEY or a SANDSHREW…\\pThat cost me a bundle, it did!$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeOhGoAhead":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pOh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_LEVEL_UP}{PAUSE 0x60}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\pOkay, then.\\nPlease, go right ahead.$","Text_PleaseComeAgain":"Please come again!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ChairmanReallyAdoresHisMons":"Our CHAIRMAN really does adore his\\nPOKéMON.\\pBut the person who is most liked by\\nPOKéMON is DAISY, I think.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeDefeat":"Now that's a shocker!\\pYou're the real deal, kid!\\pFine, then, take the THUNDERBADGE!$","Text_BlinkingLights":"Lights in different colors are\\nflashing on and off.$","VermilionCity_Text_BoardSeagallopFerry":"Would you like to board\\na SEAGALLOP ferry?$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_TylerDefeat":"Wow! \\nYou're great!$","Route5_SouthEntrance_Text_ThirstyOnGuardDuty":"I'm on guard duty.\\nGee, I'm thirsty, though!\\pOh, wait there, the road's closed.$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AllMonWeakToSpecificTypes":"It is true that a higher-level\\nPOKéMON will be more powerful…\\pBut, all POKéMON will have weak\\npoints against specific types.\\pSo, there appears to be no\\nuniversally strong POKéMON.$","CableClub_Text_PleaseWaitBCancel":"Please wait.\\n… … B Button: Cancel$","Route9_Text_ChrisPostBattle":"Keep walking!$","CableClub_Text_PlayWhichBattleMode":"Which Battle Mode would you like\\nto play?$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroUseSonicboom":"Okay! SLOWBRO!\\nUse SONICBOOM!$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ThankYouHaveHMForCut":"CAPTAIN: Whew! Thank you!\\nI'm feeling much better now.\\pYou want to see my hidden CUT\\ntechnique?\\pI could show you my prized CUT\\ntechnique if I weren't so ill…\\pI know! You can have this!\\nThis HIDDEN MACHINE!\\pTeach CUT to your POKéMON, and\\nyou can see it CUT anytime!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM34":"TM34 contains SHOCK WAVE!\\pTeach it to an ELECTRIC POKéMON!$","PalletTown_Text_CaughtXPuttingInHonestEffort":"You've caught {STR_VAR_2}…\\pHm, it looks as if you're putting\\nin an honest effort.\\pWhen you manage to fill it some\\nmore, come show me, please.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyDefeat":"I lost.$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_ExchangedVoucherForBicycle":"{PLAYER} exchanged the\\nBIKE VOUCHER for a BICYCLE.$","Route25_Text_JoeyRematchIntro":"I won't lose while I'm here!$","Text_Painting":"It's a pretty picture of a POKéMON.\\nIt looks like it's feeling good.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosDefeat":"Wow!\\nShocked again!$","Route24_Text_CalePostBattle":"I did my best. I have no regrets!$","Route9_Text_CaitlinIntro":"Don't you dare patronize me!$","CeruleanCity_Text_RivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: Yo! {PLAYER}!\\pYou're still struggling along back\\nhere?\\pI'm doing great! I caught a bunch\\nof strong and smart POKéMON!\\pHere, let me see what you caught,\\n{PLAYER}!$","Route6_Text_IsabelleDefeat":"Things just didn't work…$","Route3_Text_GregPostBattle":"If a POKéMON BOX on the PC gets\\nfull, just switch to another BOX.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice":"Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\pLT. SURGE has a nickname.\\pPeople refer to him as the\\nLightning American!\\pHe's an expert on electric\\nPOKéMON.\\pBIRD/WATER-type POKéMON match\\npoorly against the ELECTRIC type.\\pBeware of paralysis, too.\\pLT. SURGE is very cautious.\\pHe's locked himself in, so it won't\\nbe easy getting to him.$","Text_SeismicTossTeach":"The secrets of space…\\nThe mysteries of earth…\\pThere are so many things about\\nwhich we know so little.\\pBut that should spur us to study\\nharder, not toss in the towel.\\pThe only thing you should toss…\\pWell, how about SEISMIC TOSS?\\nShould I teach that to a POKéMON?$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_SpeedStatFly":"The SPEED stat of all your\\nPOKéMON increases a little bit.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nFLY outside of battle.$","CableClub_Text_PleaseVisitAgain":"Please do visit again.$","PalletTown_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu":"TRAINER TIPS\\pPress START to open the MENU!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneIntro":"This is no place for kids!\\nNot even if you're good!$","CableClub_Text_HopeYouEnjoyWirelessSystem":"I hope you enjoy the Wireless\\nCommunication System.$","Text_MegaKickWhichMon":"All right!\\nWhich POKéMON wants to learn it?$","Route6_Text_ElijahPostBattle":"Are my POKéMON weak?\\nOr, am I just bad?\\lWhich do you think?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFourthPage":"Fourth page…\\pThe ultimate goal for all POKéMON\\nTRAINERS is simple.\\pIt is to defeat the top eight\\nPOKéMON GYM LEADERS.\\pDo so to earn the right to face…\\pThe ELITE FOUR of the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE!$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_YouHaveNoRoomForThis":"Oh, no!\\nYou have no room for this!$","Route11_Text_BraxtonIntro":"Careful!\\nI'm laying down some cables!$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_DaleDefeat":"I'm all out!$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IDontGiveRefunds":"MAN: Well, I don't give refunds.\\nYou knew what you were getting!$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_PhillipPostBattle":"When we're out at sea, jellyfish\\nPOKéMON sometimes drift by.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory":"Blow me away! GIOVANNI was the\\nGYM LEADER of VIRIDIAN?$","Text_DreamEaterTaught":"…ZZZ…\\nI…can't eat…anymore…$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockIntro":"So, you're here. I'm BROCK.\\nI'm PEWTER's GYM LEADER.\\pMy rock-hard willpower is evident\\neven in my POKéMON.\\pMy POKéMON are all rock hard, and\\nhave true-grit determination.\\pThat's right - my POKéMON are all\\nthe ROCK type!\\pFuhaha! You're going to challenge\\nme knowing that you'll lose?\\pThat's the TRAINER's honor that\\ncompels you to challenge me.\\pFine, then!\\nShow me your best!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_InitiatedTeleportersCellSeparator":"{PLAYER} initiated the TELEPORTER's\\nCell Separator.$","Route11_Text_HugoIntro":"Win, lose, or draw!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_YouveGotTooMuchStuff":"You've got too much stuff!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4Intro":"Little kids shouldn't be messing\\naround with grown-ups!\\pIt could be bad news!$","SSAnne_1F_Room7_Text_ThomasIntro":"I am but a solitary traveler…\\pMy sole companions and friends are\\nPOKéMON I caught on my journeys…$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_SSAnneWillSetSailSoon":"CAPTAIN: …Whew!\\pNow that I'm not sick anymore,\\nI guess it's time.\\pThe S.S. ANNE will set sail soon!\\pFarewell, until our return to\\nVERMILION CITY!$","Route3_Text_CalvinPostBattle":"I always wear shorts, even in\\nwinter. That's my policy.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosIntro":"WHOA!\\nYou shocked me!\\l…Oh, you're just a kid!$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomInfo":"The TRAINERS in the UNION ROOM\\nwill be those players around you\\lwho have also entered the ROOM.\\pYou may do all sorts of things\\nhere, such as exchanging greetings.\\pYou may enter two POKéMON up to\\nLv. 30 for a one-on-one battle.\\pYou may take part in a chat with\\ntwo to five people.\\pOr, you may register a POKéMON for\\ntrade.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TurnThePage":"Turn the page?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontLikeWayItGlaresAtYou":"{PLAYER}, I don't like the way it\\nglares at you.\\pCould you try being a little nicer\\nto it?$","Route25_Text_JoeyPostBattle":"All POKéMON have weaknesses.\\nEven the strongest ones.\\pThat's why it's best to raise\\nPOKéMON of different types.$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_GreatHereYouGo":"Great! You have caught or owned\\n{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pCongratulations!\\nHere you go!$","Route3_Text_RobinDefeat":"That's it?$","Route21_North_Text_WadeIntro":"I got a big haul!\\nWanna go for it?$","Route6_Text_ElijahDefeat":"You're too good!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_WhyWouldMonHateYouSoMuch":"…Um, it's not easy for me to say\\nthis, but…\\pIs there some reason why your\\nPOKéMON would hate you so much?$","ViridianForest_Text_UseAntidoteForPoison":"For poison, use ANTIDOTE!\\nGet it at POKéMON MARTS!$","Route24_Text_EthanPostBattle":"I did my best. I have no regrets!$","Route1_Text_WorkAtPokeMartTakeSample":"Hi!\\nI work at a POKéMON MART.\\pIt's part of a convenient chain\\nselling all sorts of items.\\pPlease, visit us in VIRIDIAN CITY.\\pI know, I'll give you a sample.\\nHere you go!$","Route11_Text_DirkPostBattle":"You were just lucky, that's all.$","CeruleanCity_House3_Text_PleaseTradeWithMyHusband":"My husband likes trading POKéMON.\\pYou're collecting POKéMON for your\\nPOKéDEX, aren't you?\\pWould you please trade with him?$","Route9_Text_ConnerIntro":"Go, my super BUG POKéMON!$","Route9_Text_BrentRematchIntro":"I got up early every day to train\\nmy POKéMON from cocoons!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LovelyAndSweetClefairy":"“The lovely and sweet\\nCLEFAIRY”$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ExplainVSSeeker":"How do you use the VS SEEKER?\\nThere's nothing to it.\\pUse it like beep-beep-beep, and\\nTRAINERS around you will notice.\\pIf any TRAINER wants a rematch,\\nit will let you know immediately.\\pCharge its battery and use it\\nwhile you're on a road.$","CeruleanCity_House2_Text_TeamRocketLeftWayOut":"TEAM ROCKET left a way out!$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests":"Many POKéMON live only in forests \\nand caves.\\pYou need to be persistent and look\\neverywhere to get different kinds.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_KentDefeat":"You got me!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_DefenseStatSurf":"The DEFENSE stat of all your\\nPOKéMON increases a little bit.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nSURF outside of battle.$","Text_PlayerFacingTVScreen":"There's a POKéMON on TV!\\nIt looks like it's having fun.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM26":"TM26 contains EARTHQUAKE.\\pIt is a powerful attack that causes\\na massive tremor.\\pI made it when I ran the GYM here,\\nfar too long ago… $","ViridianForest_Text_SammyIntro":"Hey, wait up!\\nWhat's the hurry? Why the rush?$","Text_PowerPlantMachine":"What could this machine be?\\nBetter not mess around with it!$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YoullNeedMoreMoney":"You'll need more money than that!$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GiveHM05IfSeen10Mons":"Hi! Remember me?\\nI'm one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\\pIf your POKéDEX has complete data\\non ten species, I'm supposed to\\lgive you a reward.\\pPROF. OAK entrusted me with\\nHM05 for you.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\\pHave you gathered data on at least\\nten kinds of POKéMON?$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgeIntro":"Hey, kid! What do you think you're\\ndoing here?\\pYou won't live long in combat!\\nNot with your puny power!\\pI tell you, kid, electric POKéMON\\nsaved me during the war!\\pThey zapped my enemies into\\nparalysis!\\pThe same as I'll do to you!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$","SSAnne_1F_Room1_Text_ImAGlobalPoliceAgent":"Ssh…!\\nI'm a GLOBAL POLICE agent.\\pI'm on the trail of TEAM ROCKET.\\nThey're up to nothing good!$","Text_SeismicTossDeclined":"Is that so?\\nI'm sure you'll be back for it.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ItsFreeLetsGetHappening":"It's a free service!\\nLet's get happening!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_GoCrushBerriesAtDirectCorner":"There's something new on the second\\nfloor of POKéMON CENTERS, at the\\lDIRECT CORNER.\\pThey installed a Wireless Adapter\\nmachine for crushing BERRIES.\\pThis is where you come in.\\pI have a favor to ask, one that\\nI can entrust only to you.\\pCould you make BERRY POWDER for\\nme using that machine?\\pDon't forget, the machine is at the\\nDIRECT CORNER of POKéMON CENTERS.\\pI'll concoct medicine for you if\\nyou bring me some BERRY POWDER.\\pDon't forget, crush BERRIES into\\nBERRY POWDER and bring it to me.$","SSAnne_2F_Room1_Text_SleepingMonLookedLikeThis":"I've journeyed far and wide, but in\\nall my travels I've never seen\\lany POKéMON sleep like this one!\\pIt was something like this!$","VermilionCity_Text_GymSign":"VERMILION CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: LT. SURGE\\lThe Lightning American!$","CableClub_Text_ExplainBattleModes":"There are three Battle Modes.\\pSINGLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.\\pDOUBLE BATTLE is for two TRAINERS\\nwith two or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER will send out two\\nPOKéMON in battle at a time.\\pMULTI BATTLE is for four TRAINERS\\nwith one or more POKéMON each.\\pEach TRAINER can have one POKéMON\\nin battle at a time.$","Route3_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 3\\nMT. MOON AHEAD$","Route1_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 1\\nPALLET TOWN - VIRIDIAN CITY$","Text_TellMoreNextTime":"Please tell me more about\\nyourself next time!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_ThankYouHeresMon":"Thank you!\\nHere's your POKéMON.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_GreatHereYouGo":"Great! You have caught or owned\\n{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pCongratulations!\\nHere you go!$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_TrevorPostBattle":"My pa said there are 100 kinds of\\nPOKéMON. I think there are more.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCompleteMonGuideWasMyDream":"To make a complete guide on all\\nthe POKéMON in the world…\\pThat was my dream!\\pBut, I'm too old.\\nI can't get the job done.\\pSo, I want you two to fulfill my\\ndream for me.\\pGet moving, you two.\\pThis is a great undertaking in\\nPOKéMON history!$","VermilionCity_House3_Text_PidgeyFlyLetterToSaffron":"I'm getting my PIDGEY to fly a\\nletter to SAFFRON in the north.$","Route6_Text_IsabelleIntro":"Me?\\nWell, okay. I'll play!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiPostBattle":"I'm still not worthy!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_ThenThisFossilIsMine":"All right.\\nThen this fossil is mine!$","Route3_Text_RobinPostBattle":"ROUTE 4 is at the foot of\\nMT. MOON.$","CableClub_Text_TradePokemon":"Would you like to trade POKéMON?$","Text_Bookshelf":"It's crammed full of POKéMON\\nbooks.$","ViridianForest_Text_CantCatchOwnedMons":"TRAINER TIPS\\pYou can't catch a POKéMON that\\nbelongs to someone else.\\pThrow POKé BALLS only at wild\\nPOKéMON to catch them!$","Text_IdLoveToHearYourProfile":"Hi, glad to meet you!\\p…That's unfriendly of you.\\nHow about saying hi back?\\pSo, come on, tell me about\\nyourself.\\pI'd love to hear your profile!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LookingNiceInNoTime":"DAISY: Okay, I'll get it looking\\nnice in no time.$","Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem":"Let's see…\\nUh-oh! You have caught only\\l{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\\pYou need {STR_VAR_1} kinds\\nif you want the {STR_VAR_2}.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_OnlyDoingThisAsFavorToYou":"No? You say no? I'm only doing this\\nas a favor to you!$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyPostBattle":"Sometimes, you can find stuff on\\nthe ground.\\pI'm looking for the stuff I\\ndropped. Can you help me?$","Route25_Text_ChadPostBattle":"If your POKéMON gets confused,\\nswitch it out.\\pThat's a good tactic.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalJustLetMeHandleEverything":"{RIVAL}: Hey, I heard that!\\pGramps, what's with favoring\\n{PLAYER} over me all the time?\\pI went and collected more POKéMON,\\nand faster, too.\\pYou should just let me handle\\neverything.$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_DalePostBattle":"Party?\\pThe cruise ship's party should be\\nover by now.$","Route24_Text_EthanRematchIntro":"Okay!\\nI'll stomp you!$","DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_DiglettDugThisTunnel":"Well, isn't this a surprise!\\nDIGLETT dug this long tunnel!\\pIt goes right to VIRIDIAN CITY,\\nthey tell me.$","Route11_Text_YasuRematchIntro":"I'm the best in my class.\\nI train every morning and night!$","PewterCity_Text_SwitchedShoesWithRunningShoes":"{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\\nRUNNING SHOES.$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution":"Do you know the evolution-cancel\\ntechnique?\\pWhen a POKéMON is evolving, you\\ncan stop the process.\\pIt's a technique for raising\\nPOKéMON the way they are.$","CableClub_Text_NeedBerryForBerryCrush":"To use the BERRY CRUSH service,\\nyou must have at least one BERRY.$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureLtSurge":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: VERMILION GYM\\nLEADER LT. SURGE!\\pLT. SURGE is rumored to have been\\na pilot while home in America.\\pHe used the electricity generated\\nby POKéMON to power his plane.$","Route25_Text_WayneDefeat":"You're something.$","ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV":"Hm… You're too busy to not even\\nhave the time for TEACHY TV…\\pTime is money, and neither should\\nbe ill spent…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalWhatDidYouCallMeFor":"{RIVAL}: I almost forgot!\\nWhat did you call me for?$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroPunch":"SLOWBRO, punch!$","PokedexRating_Text_LookForwardToFilledNationalDex":"I'll be looking forward to seeing\\nyou fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$","Route11_Text_DirkRematchIntro":"Fwahaha!\\nI have never lost!\\p…And if I did, I've forgotten all\\nabout it!$","Route6_Text_RickyDefeat":"I just can't win!$","Text_DreamEaterWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nDREAM EATER?$","VermilionCity_House3_Text_SendMyPidgeyToUnionRoom":"I want to exchange MAIL with all\\nsorts of people.\\pI send my PIDGEY to a UNION ROOM\\nto exchange MAIL for me.$","SSAnne_1F_Room3_Text_CruiseIsElegantAndCozy":"A world cruise is so elegant yet\\ncozy!$","Route6_Text_ElijahRematchIntro":"Hey, long time!\\nHave you gotten better?$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle":"Darn it all!\\nMy associates won't stand for this!$","Text_DecorTransferredToPC":"The {STR_VAR_2} was transferred\\nto the PC.$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsToTrade":"For trading, you must have at\\nleast two POKéMON with you.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiPostBattle":"The POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nYou? Don't get cocky!$","CableClub_Text_FirstTimeRightThisWay":"Hello!\\nMy name is TEALA.\\pThis must be your first time\\nup here.\\pI'll show you how the Wireless\\nCommunication System works.\\pFirst, I need to show you this\\nfloor of our POKéMON CENTER.\\pRight this way, please.$","SSAnne_1F_Room6_Text_SorryYouLookLikeMyBrother":"Oh, I'm sorry for fussing over you.\\nYou look like my little brother…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelPostBattle":"You can go on to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE only by defeating our GYM\\lLEADER!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Seel":"SEEL: Kyuoo!$","Trade_Text_ThisIsntMon":"Hmmm?\\nThis isn't a {STR_VAR_1}.\\pThink of me if you get one.$","Text_PutItemAway":"{PLAYER} put the {STR_VAR_2}\\nin the {STR_VAR_3}.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_GroomWhichOne":"Which one should I groom?$","Route24_Text_TimmyIntro":"Here's No. 3!\\nI won't be easy!$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_EdmondIntro":"Hey, matey!\\pLet's do a little jig!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingCharmander":"Ah! CHARMANDER is your choice.\\nYou should raise it patiently.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you're claiming the\\nFIRE POKéMON CHARMANDER?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsGoingToHaveRadioShow":"PROF. OAK is going to have his own\\nradio show soon.\\pThe program will be called PROF.\\nOAK's POKéMON SEMINAR.$","Route24_Text_TimmyPostBattle":"I did my best. I have no regrets!$","SSAnne_2F_Room6_Text_CaptainIsAwfullySick":"The CAPTAIN said he's awfully sick.\\nHe was all pale.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OaksLastMon":"That's PROF. OAK's last POKéMON.$","CableClub_Text_EnjoyUnionRoom":"I hope you enjoy your time in\\nthe UNION ROOM.$","Route9_Text_DrewDefeat":"Can't measure up…$","Route11_Text_BernieDefeat":"Whoa!\\nYou spark plug!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_KabutopsFossil":"KABUTOPS Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ShouldStoreMonsUsingPC":"Sometimes, you'll have too many\\nPOKéMON with you to add any more.\\pIn that case, you should just\\nstore some using any PC.$","Route9_Text_DrewRematchIntro":"I'm taking ROCK TUNNEL to go to\\nLAVENDER…\\pBut I keep getting stopped by\\neveryone along the way…$","ViridianCity_House_Text_Speary":"SPEARY: Tetweet!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadBlackboardCarefully":"Okay!\\pBe sure to read what's on the\\nblackboard carefully!$","Route11_Text_EddieRematchIntro":"You know, right?\\nLet's go, but don't cheat!$","PalletTown_Text_PlayersHouse":"{PLAYER}'s house$","VermilionCity_Text_GrimerMultipliesInSludge":"We're careful about pollution here.\\pWe've heard GRIMER multiplies in\\ntoxic sludge.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room5_Text_Machoke":"MACHOKE: Gwoh! Goggoh!$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ChairmanVeryVocalAboutPokemon":"Our CHAIRMAN is very vocal about\\nPOKéMON.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamIntro":"Stop right there, kid!\\pYou're ten thousand light-years \\nfrom facing BROCK!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_WhatWillYouBattleWith":"If you leave me that POKéMON,\\nwhat will you battle with?$","Route22_Text_LateRivalDefeat":"What!?\\pI was just careless, you!$","PewterCity_Text_MuseumOfScience":"PEWTER MUSEUM OF SCIENCE$","Text_Snacks":"There's a pile of snacks here.$","PewterCity_House1_Text_TradeMonsAreFinicky":"Our POKéMON's an outsider, so it's\\nfinicky and hard to handle.\\pAn outsider is a POKéMON that you\\nget in a trade.\\pIt grows fast, but it may ignore an\\nunskilled TRAINER in battle.\\pIf only we had some BADGES…$","PewterCity_Text_DidYouCheckOutMuseum":"Did you check out the MUSEUM?$","Route24_Text_EthanIntro":"Okay! I'm No. 5!\\nI'll stomp you!$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_IncredibleNewsHaveBerries":"Oh, oh!\\nTh-this news report!\\pHmm…\\pAmazing!\\nWhat an incredible piece of news!\\pI haven't seen a news story this\\nincredible in too long a time!\\pThanks for sharing this fantastic\\nnews. Have a bunch of BERRIES!$","VermilionCity_Text_SnorlaxBlockingRoute12":"NOTICE!\\pROUTE 12 may be blocked off by a\\nsleeping POKéMON.\\pDetour through ROCK TUNNEL to\\nLAVENDER TOWN.\\pVERMILION POLICE$","ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, are you filling your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pAt first, focus on weakening the\\nPOKéMON before trying to catch it.$","PewterCity_Text_ClefairyCameFromMoon":"CLEFAIRY came from the moon.\\nThat's what the rumor is.\\pThey appeared after MOON STONES\\nfell on MT. MOON.$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney":"You don't have enough money.$","VermilionCity_Text_TheShipSetSail":"The ship set sail.$","Route24_Text_EthanDefeat":"Whoa!\\nToo much!$","Route11_Text_JasperIntro":"Competition!\\nI can't get enough!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle":"You made me mad!\\nTEAM ROCKET will blacklist you!$","Text_BagIsFull":"The BAG is full…$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_TakeThisAndFish":"Grand! I like your style.\\nI think we can be friends.\\pTake this and fish, young friend!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PlayedWithNES":"{PLAYER} played with the NES.\\p…Okay!\\nIt's time to go!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_WantMeToRaiseMon":"I run the DAY-CARE service.\\pWould you like me to raise one of\\nyour POKéMON?$","Route11_Text_HugoDefeat":"Atcha!\\nDidn't go my way!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ExplainTownMap":"You can use the TOWN MAP to find\\nout where you are, or check the\\lnames of places.$","Route25_Text_KelseyIntro":"Hi!\\nMy boyfriend is cool!$","Route1_Text_PutPotionAway":"{PLAYER} put the POTION away in\\nthe BAG's ITEMS POCKET.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ThereYouGoAllDone":"{FONT_NORMAL}{STR_VAR_1} looks dreamily content…\\p{FONT_FEMALE}DAISY: There you go! All done.\\nSee? Doesn't it look nice?\\pGiggle…\\nIt's such a cute POKéMON.$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_FishingIsAWayOfLife":"Fishing is a way of life!\\nIt is like the finest poetry.\\pFrom the seas to rivers, go out\\nand land the big one, my friend.$","SSAnne_2F_Corridor_Text_RivalDefeat":"Humph!\\pAt least you're raising your\\nPOKéMON!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ComeAgain":"Come again!$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_MagnificentNewsSpreadHaveBerries":"You've spread the news some more?\\nMagnificent!\\pThat piece of news must be\\ndelighted to be passed around so.\\pYes, indeed!\\pConsider this a show of\\nappreciation from me and the news.\\pI'll give you more BERRIES than\\nI usually do.$","ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics":"If there's something you don't\\nunderstand, watch that.\\pIt will teach you about the basics\\nof being a POKéMON TRAINER.$","ViridianForest_Text_ContactOakViaPCToRatePokedex":"TRAINER TIPS\\pContact PROF. OAK via a PC to\\nget your POKéDEX evaluated!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_SeeMeIfYoudLikeToTradePowder":"Come see me if you'd like to trade\\nyour BERRY POWDER.$","Route25_Text_HaleyDefeat":"I'm not so jealous!$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_TrevorDefeat":"I was just careless!$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_LeonardDefeat":"Right!\\nGood battle, mate!$","Route1_Text_ComeSeeUsIfYouNeedPokeBalls":"Please come see us if you need\\nPOKé BALLS for catching POKéMON.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTookBothPokedexUnits":"PROF. OAK took both POKéDEX\\nunits.$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClubFirstTime":"On the top floor, there are two\\nrooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_NothingEntertaining":"Sigh…\\nToo much time, too little to do…\\pIs nothing entertaining happening\\nanywhere?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ExplainEarthBadgeTakeThis":"The EARTHBADGE makes POKéMON of\\nany level obey without question.\\pIt is evidence of your mastery as\\na POKéMON TRAINER.\\pWith it, you can challenge the\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE.\\pAlso, take this TM.\\pConsider it a gift for your POKéMON\\nLEAGUE challenge.$","Route3_Text_GregRematchIntro":"You're a TRAINER, aren't you?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyIntro":"I might be little, but I won't like\\nit if you go easy on me!$","Route24_Text_ReliDefeat":"I lost, too!$","Trade_Text_HasTradedMonGrownStronger":"The {STR_VAR_2} that I traded you,\\nhas it grown stronger?$","Route3_Text_JamesRematchIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI started raising.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingBulbasaur":"I see! BULBASAUR is your choice.\\nIt's very easy to raise.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you want to go with\\nthe GRASS POKéMON BULBASAUR?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YouDoNotHaveSpace":"You do not have space for this!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_LikeMeToGroomMon":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\nGood timing.\\pI'm about to have some tea.\\nWould you like to join me?\\pOh, but look.\\nYour POKéMON are a little dirty.\\pWould you like me to groom one?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_NotFamiliarWithYouYet":"It's not quite familiar with you\\nyet.\\pPOKéMON are all quite wary when\\nyou first get them.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaIntro":"What? You?\\nI'm more than good enough for you!\\pMISTY won't have to be bothered.$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_WellEachTakeAFossil":"We'll each take a fossil!\\nNo being greedy!$","ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pThe battle moves of POKéMON are\\nlimited by their POWER POINTS, PP.\\pTo replenish PP, rest your tired\\nPOKéMON at a POKéMON CENTER.$","Route21_North_Text_WadeDefeat":"Heheh, MAGIKARP just don't make\\nthe grade, do they?$","Route25_Text_NobDefeat":"You done got me, and real good,\\ntoo!$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_BikesCoolButExpensive":"These bikes are cool, but they're\\nway expensive!$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichCableClubService":"Welcome to the POKéMON CABLE\\nCLUB.\\pWhich of our services do you wish\\nto use?$","PewterCity_Text_ThisIsTheMuseum":"This is it, the MUSEUM.\\pYou have to pay to get in, but it's\\nworth it. See you around!$","Text_AccessedBillsPC":"Accessed BILL's PC.$","Route11_Text_DarianRematchIntro":"I have never won before…\\pPerhaps I am destined to remain\\nthat way…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelIntro":"VIRIDIAN GYM was closed for a\\nlong time.\\pBut now, our LEADER is back!$","Text_MonSentToBoxSomeonesBoxFull":"BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\\nSomeone's PC was full.\\p{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_GotToBuySomePotions":"I've got to buy some POTIONS.\\pYou never know when your POKéMON\\nwill need quick healing.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HeardYouBattledRival":"DAISY: {PLAYER}, I heard you had\\na battle against {RIVAL}.\\pI wish I'd seen that!$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamPostBattle":"You're pretty hot.\\n…But not as hot as BROCK!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_MakeRoomInYourBag":"Yo, kid, make room in your BAG!$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM03":"TM03 teaches WATER PULSE.\\pUse it on an aquatic POKéMON!$","Text_ObtainedTheDecor":"Obtained the {STR_VAR_2}!$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PaidOutrageouslyForMagikarp":"{PLAYER} paid an outrageous ¥500\\nand bought the MAGIKARP…$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ShopDoesGoodBusinessInAntidotes":"This shop does good business in\\nANTIDOTES, I've heard.$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4Defeat":"I'm steamed!$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_TylerIntro":"I love POKéMON!\\nDo you?$","CableClub_Text_ExplainWirelessClub":"Let me explain how the POKéMON\\nWIRELESS CLUB works.\\pOn this, the top floor, there are\\ntwo rooms.\\pFirst, the room on the left.\\nIt's the UNION ROOM.\\pYou may link up with TRAINERS\\naround you who have also entered\\lthe UNION ROOM.\\pWith them, you may do things like\\nchat, battle, and trade.\\pSecond, the room on the right is\\nthe DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may trade or battle POKéMON\\nwith your friends in this room.\\pSometimes, you may not be able to\\nfind your friends in the UNION ROOM\\lor the DIRECT CORNER.\\pIn that case, please move closer\\nto your friends.\\pIf the Wireless Adapter isn't\\nconnected, you may still link up\\lusing a GBA Game Link cable.\\pIf that is the case, you must go\\nto the DIRECT CORNER.\\pI hope you enjoy the Wireless \\nCommunication System.$","Route25_Text_SeaCottageSign":"SEA COTTAGE\\nBILL lives here!$","Route11_Text_JasperDefeat":"I had a chance!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalNoFairWhatAboutMe":"{RIVAL}: Hey! Gramps! No fair!\\nWhat about me?$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_OnlyHaveOneMonWithYou":"Oh? You only have one POKéMON\\nwith you.$","Trade_Text_ThisIsNoMon":"…This is no {STR_VAR_1}.\\pIf you get one, trade it with me.$","Route21_North_Text_LilPostBattle":"LIL: I'm tired.\\nCan't we go home already?$","Route25_Text_HaleyRematchIntro":"My friend has many cute POKéMON.\\nI'm so jealous!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_TakeInterestInAllSortsOfThings":"You have no interest in BERRIES?\\pYoung one, it's important to take an\\ninterest in all sorts of things.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainSleep":"A POKéMON can't attack if it's\\nasleep.\\pPOKéMON will stay asleep even\\nafter battles.\\pUse AWAKENING to awaken one\\nfrom sleep.$","CeruleanCity_Text_GruntIntro":"Hey! Stay out!\\nIt's not your yard!\\p…Huh?\\nMe?\\pI'm an innocent bystander!\\nDon't you believe me?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$","Trade_Text_HowIsMyOldMon":"How is my old {STR_VAR_2}?\\nMy {STR_VAR_1} is doing great!$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_EdmondDefeat":"You're impressive!$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LaddieBuyMagikarpForJust500":"MAN: Hello there, laddie!\\nHave I got a deal just for you!\\pI'll let you have a secret POKéMON\\n- a MAGIKARP - for just ¥500!\\pSo, you'll buy it, am I right?$","Route11_Text_DirkDefeat":"My first loss!$","CeruleanCity_Text_BikeShopSign":"Grass and caves handled easily!\\nBIKE SHOP$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllTakeThisOneThen":"{RIVAL}: I'll take this one, then!$","VermilionCity_Text_SSAnneVisitsOnceAYear":"The S.S. ANNE is a famous luxury\\ncruise ship.\\pIt visits VERMILION once a year.$","Route6_Text_RickyIntro":"Who's there?\\nQuit listening in on us!$","VermilionCity_Text_OhMysticTicketTakeYouToNavelRock":"Oh! That's a MYSTICTICKET!\\nNow that is rare.\\pWe'll be happy to take you to\\nNAVEL ROCK anytime.$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_OhBikeVoucherHereYouGo":"Oh, that's…\\pA BIKE VOUCHER!\\pOkay!\\nHere you go!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiDefeat":"I ran out of gas!$","VermilionCity_Text_DoYouHaveATicket":"Welcome to the S.S. ANNE!\\pExcuse me, do you have a ticket?$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_AllMonsWillObeyYou":"All POKéMON will obey you!$","ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles":"TRAINER TIPS\\pCatch POKéMON and expand your\\ncollection.\\pThe more you have, the easier it\\nis to battle.$","ViridianForest_Text_AvoidGrassyAreasWhenWeak":"TRAINER TIPS\\pIf your POKéMON are weak and you\\nwant to avoid battles, stay away\\lfrom grassy areas!$","PewterCity_Text_ThatsRightItsHardWork":"That's right!\\nIt's hard work!$","Text_SeismicTossTaught":"I hope you won't toss in the towel.\\nKeep it up.$","Route11_Text_DillonDefeat":"My POKéMON couldn't win…\\nHaven't they grown enough?$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_SSAnnePartyYouGoInstead":"That cruise ship S.S. ANNE is in\\nVERMILION CITY.\\pI hear there are lots of TRAINERS\\non board, too.\\pThey invited me to their party, but\\nI can't stand fancy do's.\\pWhy don't you go instead of me?\\nGo on and have a good time.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakFavorToAskYouPlayer":"Ah, now this is excellent!\\p{PLAYER}, I have another important\\nfavor to ask of you.\\pI need you to listen closely.$","CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerTipsHeldItems":"TRAINER TIPS\\pA POKéMON can be made to hold\\nan item.\\pSome items can even be used by\\nthe holding POKéMON in battle.$","Route24_Text_ReliRematchIntro":"You always look so busy…\\nAren't you getting tired?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTakeTheseWithYou":"OAK: {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}.\\nTake these with you.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_DuncanDefeat":"Your spirit sank me!$","ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis":"There! Now tell me, that was\\neducational, was it not?\\pAnd here, take this, too.$","Text_Kitchen":"It smells delicious!\\nSomebody's been cooking here.$","PalletTown_Text_SignsAreUsefulArentThey":"Signs are useful, aren't they?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakAddedNothingToPokedex":"Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nHow is your POKéDEX shaping up?\\p{RIVAL} has already caught some\\nPOKéMON and added to the data.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let's have a look at\\nyour POKéDEX.\\p…What's the matter?\\nYou've added no new data at all.\\pI'll give you these, so do try a\\nlittle harder.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_TakeThisToProfOak":"You know PROF. OAK, right?\\pHis order came in.\\nCan I get you to take it to him?$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalPostBattle":"I heard the POKéMON LEAGUE is\\ncrawling with tough TRAINERS.\\pI have to figure out how to get\\npast them.\\pYou should quit dawdling and get a\\nmove on!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_HaveJustTheThing":"Ah, good! For you, then, I have\\njust the thing.$","PokedexRating_Text_ThankYouMadeDreamReality":"Thank you, {PLAYER}!\\nSincerely, thank you!\\lYou've made my dream a reality!$","CableClub_Text_YouHaveAMonThatCantBeTaken":"You have at least one POKéMON\\nthat can't be taken.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_NopeOnlyTrashHere":"Nope!\\nThere's only trash here.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BetterMakeRoomForThis":"You better make room for this!$","VermilionCity_Text_Seagallop7Departing":"Okay, everything's in order.\\pSEAGALLOP HI-SPEED 7 will be\\ndeparting immediately.$","ViridianForest_Text_RickDefeat":"No!\\nCATERPIE can't hack it!$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroWithdraw":"SLOWBRO, WITHDRAW!$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_LamarIntro":"Which do you find more worthy,\\na strong or a rare POKéMON?$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_HearAboutSnorlaxItsAGlutton":"Did you hear about SNORLAX?\\nIt's a glutton.\\pNo other POKéMON eats and sleeps\\nthe way SNORLAX can and does!$","Text_RestoredPkmnToFullHealth":"Thank you for waiting.\\nWe've restored your POKéMON to\\lfull health.$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCenterInEveryTown":"There's a POKéMON CENTER in every\\ntown ahead.\\pThey charge no money, so don't\\nbe shy about healing POKéMON.$","Route9_Text_BricePostBattle":"Hahaha!\\nKids should be tough!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_2F_Text_PressLRForHelp":"It's a posted notice…\\pIf you're confused, ask for HELP!\\nPress the L or R Button!$","Trade_Text_HeyThanks":"Hey, thanks!$","Text_SeismicTossWhichMon":"Which POKéMON wants to learn\\nSEISMIC TOSS?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_YujiPostBattle":"You'll need power to keep up with\\nour GYM LEADER.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_YouCameFromPallet":"Hey!\\nYou came from PALLET TOWN?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainParalysis":"Paralysis reduces SPEED and may\\nprevent the POKéMON from moving.\\pParalysis remains after battles.\\nUse PARLYZ HEAL for treatment.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ListenPolitelyToOtherTrainers":"Let's all listen politely to other\\nTRAINERS!$","Route11_Text_BerniePostBattle":"Well, better get back to work.$","Route4_Text_CrissyPostBattle":"There might not be any more\\nmushrooms here.\\pI think I got them all.$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1Intro":"We, TEAM ROCKET, shall find the\\nfossils!\\pReviving POKéMON from them will\\nearn us huge riches!$","PewterCity_Text_CallPoliceIfInfoOnThieves":"NOTICE!\\pThieves have been stealing POKéMON\\nfossils from MT. MOON.\\pPlease call the PEWTER POLICE if\\nyou have any information.$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2Intro":"We, TEAM ROCKET, are POKéMON\\ngangsters!\\lWe strike fear with our strength!$","CableClub_Text_UseBerryCrush":"Would you like to use the\\nBERRY CRUSH System?$","Route2_House_Text_FaintedMonsCanUseFieldMoves":"A fainted POKéMON just has no\\nenergy left to battle.\\pIt can still use moves like CUT\\noutside of battle.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room3_Text_DylanDefeat":"Argh!\\nLost it!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalFedUpWithWaiting":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!\\nI'm fed up with waiting!$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeader":"Please decide which of you will\\nbecome the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","Trade_Text_DoYouHaveMonWouldYouTradeForMon":"Hello, there! Do you happen to\\nhave a {STR_VAR_1}?\\pWould you agree to a trade for\\nmy {STR_VAR_2}?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainPoison":"When poisoned, a POKéMON's health\\nsteadily drops.\\pPoison lingers after battles.\\nUse an ANTIDOTE to cure poison!$","ViridianCity_House_Text_MyDaddyLovesMonsToo":"My daddy loves POKéMON, too.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MakeRoomForThis":"Make room for this!$","Route25_Text_KelseyRematchIntro":"Hi!\\nMy boyfriend is cool!\\lMy conditioning's good today!$","Text_MegaKickTeach":"A kick of brutal ferocity!\\pPacked with destructive power!\\pWhen you get right down to it,\\nMEGA KICK is the ultimate attack!\\lDon't you agree?\\pOkay!\\nI'll teach it to your POKéMON!$","PewterCity_House1_Text_NidoranSit":"NIDORAN, sit!$","Route9_Text_BrentPostBattle":"I have to collect more than bugs\\nto get stronger…$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_MeteoriteThatFellOnMtMoon":"A meteorite that fell on MT. MOON.\\nIt is thought to be a MOON STONE.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHeyDontGoAwayYet":"OAK: Hey!\\nDon't go away yet!$","VermilionCity_Text_VermilionHarbor":"VERMILION HARBOR$","Text_Dresser":"It's a nicely made dresser.\\nIt will hold a lot of stuff.$","VermilionCity_Mart_Text_MonsGoodOrBadDependingOnTrainer":"I think POKéMON can be good or\\nbad. It depends on the TRAINER.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyIntro":"Hi, you're a new face!\\pOnly those TRAINERS who have a\\npolicy about POKéMON can turn pro.\\pWhat is your approach when you\\ncatch and train POKéMON?\\pMy policy is an all-out offensive\\nwith WATER-type POKéMON!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_ComeAnytimeYouLike":"Fine.\\nCome anytime you like.$","Text_BootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","Route6_Text_JeffIntro":"Huh?\\nYou want to talk to me?$","PokedexRating_Text_YouveCompletedDex":"Finally…\\pYou've finally completed the\\nPOKéDEX!\\pIt's magnificent!\\nTruly, this is a fantastic feat!$","Route6_Text_NancyIntro":"Excuse me!\\nThis is a private conversation!$","Route3_Text_BenPostBattle":"Are you using a POKéMON CENTER's\\nPC for storing your POKéMON?\\pEach BOX can hold up to\\n30 POKéMON.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_AdoreMySeel":"I just adore my SEEL!\\nIt's so lovable!\\pIt squeals, “Kyuuuh,” when I\\nhug it!$","Route9_Text_JeremyPostBattle":"You sure had guts standing up to\\nme there, eh?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ReceivedOldAmberFromMan":"{PLAYER} received the OLD AMBER\\nfrom the man.$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeUnionRoomEnter":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB UNION ROOM.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nother TRAINERS here, some of\\lwhom you may not even know.\\pWould you like to enter the ROOM?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetsGetHappening":"All right!\\nLet's get happening!$","Route9_Text_BriceRematchIntro":"Hahaha!\\nA little toughie, as always!$","Route9_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 9\\nCERULEAN CITY - ROCK TUNNEL$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_RattataHasWickedBite":"RATTATA may be small, but don't\\nunderestimate its wicked bite.\\pHave you caught one already?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_DontHaveRoomForThis":"You don't have room for this.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"VERMILION POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: LT. SURGE\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiIntro":"I'm the KARATE KING!\\nYour fate rests with me!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsQuiteFriendly":"It's quite friendly with you.\\nKeep being good to it!$","Text_MoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce":"This move can be learned only\\nonce. Is that okay?$","ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro":"Hey! You have POKéMON!\\nCome on!\\lLet's battle 'em!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_YouWantHelixFossil":"Do you want the HELIX FOSSIL?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_Jigglypuff":"JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu!$","Text_ImpressiveMachine":"It's a machine of some sort.\\nIt sure is impressive.$","SSAnne_2F_Room5_Text_HaveYouGoneToSafariZone":"Have you gone to the SAFARI ZONE\\nin FUCHSIA CITY?\\pThere are many kinds of rare\\nPOKéMON.$","Route25_Text_HaleyPostBattle":"You came from MT. MOON?\\nMay I have a CLEFAIRY?$","Route3_Text_JamesPostBattle":"Trained POKéMON are stronger than\\nthe wild ones.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThreeMonsChooseOne":"OAK: {RIVAL}?\\nLet me think…\\pOh, that's right, I told you to\\ncome! Just wait!\\pHere, {PLAYER}.\\pThere are three POKéMON here.\\pHaha!\\pThe POKéMON are held inside\\nthese POKé BALLS.\\pWhen I was young, I was a serious\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pBut now, in my old age, I have\\nonly these three left.\\pYou can have one.\\nGo on, choose!$","VermilionCity_Text_DidYouSeeSSAnneInHarbor":"Did you see the S.S. ANNE moored\\nin the harbor?$","PalletTown_Text_ReadItReadIt":"Read it, read it!$","Route25_Text_KelseyDefeat":"My conditioning isn't the best…$","CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillDoesWhateverForRareMons":"That BILL!\\pI heard that he'll do whatever it\\ntakes to get rare POKéMON.\\pHe's not above doing all sorts\\nof things, I've heard.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniIntro":"Fwahahaha!\\nWelcome to my hideout!\\pIt shall be so until I can restore\\nTEAM ROCKET to its former glory.\\pBut, you have found me again.\\nSo be it.\\lThis time, I'm not holding back!\\pOnce more, you shall face\\nGIOVANNI, the greatest TRAINER!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_ROCKET}$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroPayAttention":"Come on, SLOWBRO, pay attention!$","Route6_Text_UndergroundPathSign":"UNDERGROUND PATH\\nCERULEAN CITY - VERMILION CITY$","Route3_Text_JaniceRematchIntro":"Excuse me!\\nYou keep looking at me, don't you?$","Route1_Text_CanJumpFromLedges":"See those ledges along the road?\\pIt's a bit scary, but you can jump\\nfrom them.\\pYou can get back to PALLET TOWN\\nquicker that way.$","Text_VideoGame":"It's the latest video game!\\nIt sure looks fun!$","PewterCity_Text_WerentThoseFossilsAmazing":"Weren't those fossils from MT. MOON\\namazing?$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_LeonardIntro":"You know what they say about\\nsailors and battling!$","Route9_Text_AliciaIntro":"You have POKéMON with you!\\nYou're mine!$","Route25_Text_DanDefeat":"I'm not mad!$","PalletTown_Text_OakYouEnjoyingTraveling":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou seem to be enjoying traveling.\\pKnowing you, {PLAYER}, I can easily\\nimagine you going out to even more\\lexotic locales.\\pGood for you, good for you.\\nHohoho.$","PewterCity_Text_GymSign":"PEWTER CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\lThe Rock-Solid POKéMON TRAINER!$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfTwo":"Please decide which of you two\\nwill become the LEADER.\\pThe other player must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanDefeat":"My POKéMON won't do!$","PewterCity_Text_TrainerTipsEarningEXP":"TRAINER TIPS\\pAll POKéMON that appear in battle,\\nhowever briefly, earn EXP Points.$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_LamarDefeat":"I must salute you!$","PewterCity_Text_GoTakeOnBrock":"If you have the right stuff,\\ngo take on BROCK!$","ViridianCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PokeCentersHealMons":"POKéMON CENTERS heal your tired,\\nhurt, or fainted POKéMON.\\pThey make all POKéMON completely\\nhealthy.$","CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryoneCallsBillPokemaniac":"Have you heard about BILL?\\pEveryone calls him a POKéMANIAC!\\pI think people are just jealous of\\nBILL, though.\\pWho wouldn't want to boast about\\ntheir POKéMON?$","CableClub_Text_DirectYouToYourRoom":"I'll direct you to your room now.$","Route6_Text_KeigoPostBattle":"I like bugs, so I'm going back to\\nVIRIDIAN FOREST.$","CableClub_Text_ChooseGroupLeaderOfFour":"Please decide which of you four\\nwill become the GROUP LEADER.\\pThe other players must then choose\\n“JOIN GROUP.”$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_PhillipDefeat":"Argh!\\nBeaten by a kid!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_MonHasGrownByXLevels":"Your {STR_VAR_1} has grown a lot.\\nYes, quite a lot, I'd say.\\pLet me see…\\nBy level, it's grown by {STR_VAR_2}.\\pAren't I great?$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3Intro":"We're pulling a big job here!\\nGet lost, kid!$","PalletTown_Text_OakPokemonResearchLab":"OAK POKéMON RESEARCH LAB$","Route3_Text_SallyPostBattle":"You can avoid battles by not\\nletting TRAINERS see you.$","Route11_Text_DiglettsCave":"DIGLETT'S CAVE$","Route9_Text_CaitlinRematchIntro":"Don't you dare patronize me today!\\nWe're playing for keeps!$","Route3_Text_JamesDefeat":"Done like dinner!$","Route25_Text_ChadIntro":"I had this feeling…\\nI knew I had to battle you!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: MISTY\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","Route3_Text_BenIntro":"Hi!\\nI like shorts!\\pThey're delightfully comfy and\\neasy to wear!$","Route24_Text_TimmyRematchIntro":"You really must love coming to\\nNUGGET BRIDGE.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockPostBattle":"There are all kinds of TRAINERS in\\nthis huge world of ours.\\pYou appear to be very gifted as a\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pSo let me make a suggestion.\\pGo to the GYM in CERULEAN and test\\nyour abilities.$","CeruleanCity_Text_RivalPostBattle":"{RIVAL}: Hey, guess what?\\pI went to BILL's and got him to\\nshow me his rare POKéMON.\\pThat added a lot of pages to my\\nPOKéDEX!\\pAfter all, BILL's world famous as a\\nPOKéMANIAC.\\pHe invented the POKéMON Storage\\nSystem on PC, too.\\pSince you're using his system,\\nyou should go thank him.\\pWell, I better get rolling!\\nSmell ya later!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_AnyInterestInBerries":"I concoct a variety of medicine\\nfrom BERRY POWDER.\\pUsing good BERRY POWDER, I can\\nmake any kind of medicine.\\pNow tell me, have you any interest\\nin BERRIES?$","MtMoon_1F_Text_RobbyIntro":"You need to go through this cave\\nto get to CERULEAN CITY.$","Route11_Text_DirkIntro":"Fwahaha!\\nI have never lost!$","VermilionCity_Text_FlashedSSTicket":"{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} flashed the S.S. TICKET!\\p{FONT_MALE}Great!\\nWelcome to the S.S. ANNE!$","Route24_Text_AliPostBattle":"I did my best. I have no regrets!$","Route11_Text_JasperRematchIntro":"Competing is the ultimate thrill.\\nI still can't get enough!$","CableClub_Text_CantSingleBattleWithXPlayers":"The SINGLE BATTLE Mode can't be\\nplayed by {STR_VAR_1} players.$","Text_PokemartSign":"All your item needs fulfilled!\\nPOKéMON MART$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_ShinyNewBicycle":"A shiny new BICYCLE!$","VermilionCity_Text_OhAuroraTicketTakeYouToBirthIsland":"Oh! That's an AURORATICKET!\\nNow that is rare.\\pWe'll be happy to take you to\\nBIRTH ISLAND anytime.$","Route11_Text_DaveDefeat":"Bye-bye!\\nThank you, and good-bye!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseEnter":"Please enter.$","ViridianCity_Text_CitySign":"VIRIDIAN CITY \\nThe Eternally Green Paradise$","ViridianForest_Text_DougIntro":"Yo!\\nYou can't jam out if you're a\\lPOKéMON TRAINER!$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_RockTunnelGoodRouteToLavender":"Let's see what the binoculars have\\nto show…\\pTo get to LAVENDER TOWN from\\nCERULEAN CITY…\\pROCK TUNNEL appears to be a good\\nroute to take.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CanHaveSixMonsWithYou":"Okay, set six POKé BALLS in my\\nbelt…\\pYeah, that'll do it. At most, you\\ncan have six POKéMON with you.$","Route21_North_Text_LilNotEnoughMons":"LIL: Huh? A battle?\\nI can't be bothered to do it alone.\\lBring two POKéMON, won't you?$","Text_TooBadBagFull":"Too bad!\\nThe BAG is full…$","Route21_North_Text_LilDefeat":"LIL: Oh, see?\\nWe lost. Happy now?$","Route11_EastEntrance_1F_Text_ManInLavenderRatesNames":"Don't you think it's hard to think\\nup good names for POKéMON?\\pEspecially if you've caught a\\nwhole bunch?\\pIn LAVENDER TOWN, there's a man\\nwho rates POKéMON nicknames.\\pHe can even help you rename your\\nPOKéMON, too.$","Route3_Text_TunnelFromCeruleanTiring":"Whew… I better take a rest…\\nGroan…\\pThat tunnel from CERULEAN takes a\\nlot out of you!$","Route9_Text_JeremyDefeat":"Keep it coming, eh!\\pOh wait.\\nI'm out of POKéMON!$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_BoughtWeirdFishFromShadyGuy":"A shady old guy sucked me into\\nbuying this weird fish POKéMON!\\pIt's totally weak and it cost ¥500!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBattleMonForItToGrow":"OAK: {PLAYER}, raise your young\\nPOKéMON by making it battle.\\pIt has to battle for it to grow.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_HaveYouBroughtBerryPowder":"Er-hem! Have you brought me some\\nBERRY POWDER?$","Trade_Text_ThanksYoureAPal":"Thanks, you're a pal!$","Route25_Text_JoeyIntro":"Local TRAINERS come here to\\npractice.$","Route9_Text_AlanIntro":"Hahahaha!\\nBring it on!$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieDefeat":"Oh!\\nI lost!$","PewterCity_Text_AskedToDeliverThis":"I'm glad I caught up to you.\\nI'm PROF. OAK's AIDE.\\pI've been asked to deliver this,\\nso here you go.$","CeruleanCity_Text_RecoveredTM28FromGrunt":"{PLAYER} recovered TM28 from\\nthe TEAM ROCKET GRUNT.$","Route9_Text_ConnerPostBattle":"If you don't like BUG POKéMON,\\nyou bug me!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookSecondPage":"Second page…\\pA healthy POKéMON may be hard to\\ncatch, so weaken it first.\\pPoison, burn, or cause another\\nstatus problem to weaken it.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_PleaseGiveMonsRest":"DAISY: Just like people, POKéMON\\nare living things.\\pWhen they get tired, please give\\nthem a rest.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberContainsGeneticMatter":"AMBER contains the genetic matter\\nof ancient POKéMON.\\pThere's a LAB somewhere trying to\\nresurrect POKéMON from AMBER.$","Route21_North_Text_IanDefeat":"IAN: Awww, Sis!\\nGet it together!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ExplainThunderBadgeTakeThis":"The THUNDERBADGE cranks up your\\nPOKéMON's SPEED!\\pIt also lets your POKéMON FLY\\nlightning-quick anytime, kid!\\pYou're special, kid!\\nTake this!$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_OnlyGetToPeelOnions":"Snivel… Sniff…\\pI only get to peel onions…\\nSnivel…$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_MiguelIntro":"Hey, stop!\\pI found these fossils!\\nThey're both mine!$","Text_MayIHelpYou":"Hi, there!\\nMay I help you?$","Text_PlayerIsPlayingRightNowGoForIt":"It appears as if {STR_VAR_1} is playing\\nright now.\\lGo for it!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_TeleporterIsDisplayed":"TELEPORTER is displayed on the PC\\nmonitor.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice":"Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\pLet me give you some advice!\\pThe LEADER, MISTY, is a pro who\\nuses WATER-type POKéMON.\\pYou can drain all their water with\\nGRASS-type POKéMON.\\pOr, you might use ELECTRIC-type\\nPOKéMON and zap them!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoIntro":"Karate is the ultimate form of\\nmartial arts!$","VermilionCity_Text_PokemonFanClubSign":"POKéMON FAN CLUB\\nAll POKéMON fans welcome!$","PewterCity_Text_CitySign":"PEWTER CITY\\nA Stone Gray City$","SSAnne_2F_Room3_Text_SeenMonsFerryPeople":"Ah, yes, I have seen some POKéMON\\nferry people across the water!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThisMonIsEnergetic":"This POKéMON is really quite\\nenergetic!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MovieOnTVGirlOnBrickRoad":"There's a movie on TV.\\nA girl with her hair in pigtails is\\lwalking up a brick road.\\p…I better go, too.$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_YouveGotNoRoomForIt":"You can't take this POKéMON back\\nif you've got no room for it.$","Text_WirelessClubUndergoingAdjustments":"I'm terribly sorry.\\nThe POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\\lundergoing adjustments now.$","SSAnne_2F_Room6_Text_ManyPeopleGetSeasick":"I hear many people get seasick.$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllBoysLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll boys leave home someday.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldRematchIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainBurn":"A burn reduces ATTACK power.\\nIt also causes ongoing HP loss.\\pA burn remains after a battle.\\nUse BURN HEAL to cure a burn.$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_ReceivedOldRodFromFishingGuru":"{PLAYER} received an OLD ROD from\\nthe FISHING GURU.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsBigMapOfKanto":"It's a big map of the KANTO region.\\nNow this would be useful!$","ViridianForest_Text_CharliePostBattle":"BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\\nThey're a lot of fun!$","Route21_North_Text_IanIntro":"IAN: My sis doesn't get enough\\nexercise, so I made her come.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_YoullExchangeBerryPowderForItem":"Fine, you'll exchange your BERRY\\nPOWDER for one {STR_VAR_1}?$","PalletTown_Text_OakGrassUnsafeNeedMon":"OAK: It's unsafe!\\nWild POKéMON live in tall grass!\\pYou need your own POKéMON for\\nyour protection.\\pI know!\\nHere, come with me!$","CeruleanCity_Text_NoYouBlewItAgain":"No!\\nYou blew it again!$","ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls":"I was throwing POKé BALLS to\\ncatch POKéMON, and I ran out.\\pThat's why you can never have too\\nmany POKé BALLS.$","Text_ThankYouForAccessingMysteryGift":"Thank you for accessing the\\nMYSTERY GIFT System.$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_RubbedCaptainsBack":"{PLAYER} rubbed the CAPTAIN's\\nback!\\pRub-rub…\\nRub-rub…$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForDoubleBattle":"For a DOUBLE BATTLE, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","Text_MegaPunchDeclined":"You'll be back when you understand\\nthe worth of MEGA PUNCH.$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldIntro":"You want to know if the fish are\\nbiting?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMonsAroundWorldWait":"POKéMON around the world wait for\\nyou, {PLAYER}!$","Route22_Text_LateRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: What? {PLAYER}!\\nWhat a surprise to see you here!\\pSo you're going to the POKéMON\\nLEAGUE?\\pYou collected all the BADGES, too?\\nThat's cool!\\pThen I'll whip you, {PLAYER}, as a\\nwarm-up for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\pCome on!$","Route5_SouthEntrance_Text_ThanksIllShareTeaWithGuards":"Huh? I can have this drink?\\nGee, thanks!\\l… …\\lGlug, glug…\\l… …\\lGulp…\\lIf you want to go to SAFFRON\\lCITY…\\l… …\\lYou can go on through.\\pI'll share this TEA with the other\\nguards!$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_WishCouldShareNewsWithOthers":"It seems such a shame to not share\\nthis news with other folks…\\pI wish I could tell someone…\\nLet others know the news…$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_BarnyIntro":"Hello, stranger!\\pI can't tell if you're from the seas\\nor mountains, but stop and chat.\\pAll my POKéMON are from the sea.$","Route21_North_Text_LilRematchIntro":"LIL: Huh? A battle again?\\nIAN, can't you do it alone?$","CableClub_Text_OtherTrainerNotReady":"The other TRAINER is not ready.$","Route9_Text_AliciaDefeat":"You deceived me…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGramps":"{RIVAL}: Gramps!$","Route11_Text_YasuIntro":"I'm the best in my class.\\nI train every morning.$","CableClub_Text_LinkErrorPleaseReset":"Sorry, we have a link error…\\nPlease reset and try again.$","PokedexRating_Text_NationalDexSeenXOwnedY":"And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_EelsAuBarbecue":"Eels au Barbecue!\\pLes guests will mutiny, I fear.$","Text_MonSentToBoxInBillsPC":"{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBILL'S PC.\\pIt was placed in \\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$","VermilionCity_House2_Text_ThisIsNoMon":"…This is no {STR_VAR_1}.\\pIf you get one, please trade it\\nto me!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DoYouKnowWhatAmberIs":"You can't sneak in the back way!\\nNice try, kid, but no.\\pOh, whatever!\\nDo you know what AMBER is?$","Route11_Text_HugoRematchIntro":"Win, lose, or draw!\\nNow for our rematch!$","PewterCity_Text_MustBeGoingBackToLab":"Well, I must be going back to\\nthe LAB.\\pBye-bye!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakComeSeeMeSometime":"OAK: Come see me sometime.\\pAfter all, I want to know how your\\nPOKéDEX is coming along.$","Route24_Text_ShaneRematchIntro":"I saw your feat from the grass!$","ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow":"Wahaha!\\nIt's my grandson on the show!\\pSince he's the one doing the\\nteaching, you're bound to learn.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DaisyWillGroomMons":"Hi, {PLAYER}. I bet you've become\\ngood friends with your POKéMON.\\pBy the way, did you know about\\nDAISY?\\pIf you show DAISY your POKéMON,\\nshe can tell how much it likes you.\\pOccasionally, she will even groom\\na POKéMON for you.\\pThis is a secret, so please don't\\ntell anyone.$","SSAnne_2F_Room3_Text_SomeTreesCanBeCutDown":"Small trees can be chopped down\\nusing the move CUT.\\pBut remember this!\\nCUT is an HM technique.\\pOnce learned, it is not so easily\\ndiscarded.$","VermilionCity_House2_Text_HowIsMyOldMon":"How is my old {STR_VAR_2}?\\pMy {STR_VAR_1} is doing great!$","Text_WhatAreYouLikeNow":"What are you like now?\\nI'd really like to know.$","Route25_Text_FranklinDefeat":"You worked hard!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_OopsWrongSide":"Oops, wrong side…$","Route9_Text_ChrisRematchIntro":"I haven't forgotten you were with\\nthose good-looking POKéMON.$","Text_HiWeMeetAgain":"Hi!\\nWe meet again!$","PalletTown_Text_RivalsHouse":"{RIVAL}'s house$","SSAnne_1F_Room3_Text_AlwaysTravelWithWigglytuff":"I always travel with WIGGLYTUFF.\\nI never leave home without it.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ReadWhichTopic":"Which topic do you want to read?$","Route24_Text_ReceivedNuggetFromMysteryTrainer":"{PLAYER} received a NUGGET\\nfrom the mystery TRAINER!$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_HowDoYouLikeNewBicycle":"How do you like your new BICYCLE?\\nDo you like how it rides?\\pYou can take it out on CYCLING\\nROAD and even into caves!$","Route9_Text_ConnerRematchIntro":"Go win, my super BUG POKéMON!$","CableClub_Text_NeedTwoMonsForUnionRoom":"To enter the UNION ROOM, you must\\nhave at least two POKéMON.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_BadgesHaveAmazingSecrets":"Only skilled TRAINERS can collect\\nPOKéMON BADGES.\\pI see you have at least one.\\pThose BADGES have amazing secrets,\\ndid you know?$","ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked":"VIRIDIAN GYM's doors are locked…$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroIgnoredOrders":"SLOWBRO ignored orders…$","Route21_North_Text_IanNotEnoughMons":"IAN: We want a two-on-two battle.\\nSo can you bring two POKéMON?$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_MiguelDefeat":"Okay!\\nI'll share!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwaynePostBattle":"LT. SURGE installed the traps in\\nthe GYM himself.\\pHe set up double locks everywhere.\\nLet me give you a hint.\\pWhen you open the first lock, the\\nsecond lock is right next to it.$","Route3_Text_BenRematchIntro":"Hi! I like shorts!\\nThey're comfy and easy to wear!\\pYou should be wearing shorts, too!$","VermilionCity_House2_Text_ThatsTooBad":"That's too bad.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM03FromMisty":"{PLAYER} received TM03\\nfrom MISTY.$","ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs":"This POKéMON GYM is always closed.\\pI wonder who the LEADER is?$","ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle":"Ssh! You'll scare the bugs away.\\nAnother time, okay?$","CableClub_Text_HopeToSeeYouAgain":"I hope to see you again!$","Text_ClosedLinkToProfOaksPC":"Closed link to PROF. OAK's PC.$","Route24_Text_JustEarnedFabulousPrize":"Congratulations! You beat our\\nfive contest TRAINERS!\\pYou just earned a fabulous prize!$","Route11_Text_DavePostBattle":"Tch…\\nI better go find stronger ones!$","PalletTown_Text_TownSign":"PALLET TOWN\\nShades of your journey await!$","Route21_North_Text_IanRematchIntro":"IAN: My sis is still a slob.\\nHelp me get her into shape!$","Text_ExplainProfile":"A profile is written using four\\nwords or phrases.\\pThere're plenty of words to choose\\nfrom for your profile.\\pThe words and phrases are placed\\nin several convenient groups.\\pFirst, choose a group, then choose\\na word or phrase.\\p…It's easier than it sounds.\\nWhy don't you try it?$","MtMoon_1F_Text_ZubatIsABloodsucker":"Beware!\\nZUBAT is a bloodsucker!$","Route3_Text_JamesIntro":"I'll battle you with the POKéMON\\nI just caught.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_PhillipIntro":"Matey, you're walking the plank if\\nyou lose!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoPostBattle":"If my POKéMON were as good at\\nkarate as I…$","ViridianForest_Text_SammyDefeat":"I give!\\nYou're good at this!$","CeruleanCity_Mart_Text_DoYouKnowAboutRareCandy":"Do you know about RARE CANDY?\\nThey don't sell it in shops.\\pI think it makes POKéMON grow\\nvery quickly all of a sudden.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ItsANewspaper":"It's a newspaper.$","PokedexRating_Text_Wroooaaarrr":"Wroooooooaaaaaarrrr!$","ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet":"Oh, Grandpa!\\nDon't be so mean!\\pI'm so sorry.\\nHe hasn't had his coffee yet.$","PewterCity_Text_BrockOnlySeriousTrainerHere":"There aren't many serious POKéMON\\nTRAINERS here.\\pThey're all like BUG CATCHERS,\\nyou know, just hobbyists.\\pBut PEWTER GYM's BROCK isn't like\\nthat, not one bit.$","Route9_Text_AlanDefeat":"Hahahaha!\\nYou beat me fair!$","CeruleanCity_Text_GruntDefeat":"GRUNT: Stop! I give up!\\nI'll leave quietly!$","Route25_Text_HaleyIntro":"My friend has many cute POKéMON.\\nI'm so jealous!$","Text_OnlySkilledTrainersAllowedThrough":"Only truly skilled TRAINERS are\\nallowed through.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet!$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_CaptainIFeelSeasick":"CAPTAIN: Ooargh…\\nI feel hideous…\\lUrrp! Seasick…$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_ObeyLv70RockSmash":"POKéMON up to Lv. 70 will obey\\nyou.\\pThat includes even outsiders you\\nobtain in trades.\\pPOKéMON of higher levels will\\nbe unruly in battle, however.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nROCK SMASH outside of battle.$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_NewNewsInformativeHaveThis":"Ah!\\nA new news report!\\pHmm…\\pI see!\\nThat was quite informative!\\pI applaud you for taking interest\\nin the news at your young age.\\pAs my thanks for sharing the news\\nwith me, I want you to have this.$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_FeelSeasick":"Urf… I feel ill…\\pI got seasick, so I stepped out to\\nget some air…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniPostBattle":"Having lost in this fashion, \\nI can't face my followers.\\lI have betrayed their trust.\\pAs of today, TEAM ROCKET is\\nfinished forever!\\pAs for myself, I shall dedicate\\nmy life to training again.\\pLet us meet again someday!\\nFarewell!$","Text_CantLetYouPass":"Rules are rules.\\nI can't let you pass.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_AdmirePikachusTail":"Won't you admire my PIKACHU's\\nadorable tail?$","Route4_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 4\\nMT. MOON - CERULEAN CITY$","Route24_Text_RocketDefeat":"Arrgh!\\nYou are good!$","Route6_Text_NancyDefeat":"Ugh!\\nI hate losing.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Its50YForChildsTicket":"Yes, yes.\\nIt's ¥50 for a child's ticket.\\pWould you like to come in?$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_BrooksPostBattle":"Fifteen years ago, I would\\nhave won!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakSightingsOfRareMons":"Recently, there have been sightings\\nof many rare POKéMON species.\\pI'm talking about POKéMON that\\nhave never been seen in KANTO.\\pI would love to go see things for\\nmyself, but I'm much too old.\\pSince I can't do it, {PLAYER}, I'd\\nlike you to go in my place.$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_LookAfterMonForAWhile":"Fine, I'll look after your\\n{STR_VAR_1} for a while.$","CeruleanCity_Text_GymSign":"CERULEAN CITY POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: MISTY\\lThe Tomboyish Mermaid!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_KiyoDefeat":"Aiyah!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveRequestForYouTwo":"OAK: Oh, right!\\nI have a request for you two.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCustomBallIOrdered":"Ah! \\nIt's the custom POKé BALL!\\pI had it on order.\\nThank you!$","Route24_Text_JoinTeamRocket":"By the way, how would you like to\\njoin TEAM ROCKET?\\pWe're a group of professional\\ncriminals specializing in POKéMON!\\pWant to join?\\pAre you sure?\\pCome on, join us!\\pI'm telling you to join!\\p…Okay, you need convincing!\\pI'll make you an offer you can't\\nrefuse!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AskedDaddyToCatchPikachu":"I want a PIKACHU!\\nIt's so cute!\\pI asked my daddy to catch me one!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GiovanniDefeat":"Ha!\\nThat was a truly intense fight.\\lYou have won!\\pAs proof, here is the EARTHBADGE!\\n{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$","CableClub_Text_NotSetUpForFarAwayRegion":"I'm awfully sorry.\\pWe're not set up to conduct trades\\nwith TRAINERS far away in another\\lregion yet…$","Route24_Text_ShaneDefeat":"I thought not!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookThirdPage":"Third page…\\pPOKéMON TRAINERS seek others to\\nengage in POKéMON battles.\\pTo TRAINERS, the taste of victory\\nis sweet, indeed.\\pBattles are constantly waged at\\nPOKéMON GYMS everywhere.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_OnlyTrashLocksWereReset":"Nope!\\nThere's only trash here.\\pHey!\\nThe electric locks were reset!$","Route24_Text_CaleDefeat":"Whoo!\\nGood stuff!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_DescribeWhichBadge":"Now then…\\pWhich of the eight BADGES should\\nI describe?$","Route3_Text_SallyDefeat":"Be nice!$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldDefeat":"Dang!$","CableClub_Text_PlayersMadeDifferentSelections":"The link partners appear to have\\nmade different selections.$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_HowToConquerSeasickness":"How to Conquer Seasickness…\\nThe CAPTAIN's reading this!$","Text_HeardThatBefore":"Oh, I've heard that before…\\pMy cousin, who lives far away,\\nalways used to say that, I think.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory":"Whew!\\nThat match was electric!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_EmailMessage":"There's an e-mail message here.\\p…\\pFinally!\\nThe ultimate TRAINERS of the\\lPOKéMON LEAGUE are ready to\\ltake on all comers!\\pBring your best POKéMON and see\\nhow you rate as a TRAINER!\\pPOKéMON LEAGUE HQ\\nINDIGO PLATEAU\\pPROF. OAK, please visit us!\\n…$","Route11_Text_BraxtonPostBattle":"Spread the word to save energy!$","Route9_Text_AliciaRematchIntro":"We're to battle again?\\nThis time, you're mine!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_MonNeedsToSpendMoreTime":"You're back already?\\pYour {STR_VAR_1} needs to spend\\nsome more time with me.$","Text_WhatsYourProfile":"What's your profile?$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_PlayerGotMonBack":"{PLAYER} got {STR_VAR_1} back\\nfrom the DAY-CARE MAN.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room3_Text_DylanIntro":"I like feisty kids like you!$","Route25_Text_NobPostBattle":"The POKéMANIAC sure lives up to\\nhis name.\\pHis collection includes many rare\\nspecies of POKéMON.$","PewterCity_House1_Text_Nidoran":"NIDORAN♂: Bowbow!$","Route3_Text_CalvinIntro":"Hey! You're not wearing shorts!\\nWhat's wrong with you?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_DontHaveEnoughMoney":"You don't have enough money.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_KentPostBattle":"I saw them!\\nI'm sure they're from TEAM ROCKET!$","Route25_Text_FlintIntro":"I'm a cool guy.\\nI've got a girlfriend!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SwitchUnderTrashFirstLockOpened":"Hey! There's a switch under the\\ntrash! Turn it on!\\pThe first electric lock opened!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_LookingGreatTakeCare":"MOM: Oh, good! You and your\\nPOKéMON are looking great.\\lTake care now!$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_SawOddBerryInTrash":"I saw an odd BERRY in the trash.\\nI wonder what that was?$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_SalmonDuSalad":"Salmon du Salad!\\pLes guests may gripe it's fish\\nagain, however!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingSquirtle":"Hm! SQUIRTLE is your choice.\\nIt's one worth raising.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, you've decided on the\\nWATER POKéMON SQUIRTLE?$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ComeBackToHearStory":"Oh. Come back when you want to\\nhear my story!$","Route9_Text_JeremyRematchIntro":"Bwahaha!\\nGreat! I was bored again, eh!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_ObtainedHelixFossil":"Obtained the HELIX FOSSIL!$","CeruleanCity_Text_IfSlowbroWasntThereCouldCutTree":"If that SLOWBRO wasn't there, you\\ncould CUT down the small tree.\\pThat way, you could get to the\\nother side.\\pI think there's a way around it,\\nthough.$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_GiveItemfinderIfCaught30":"Hi! Remember me?\\nI'm one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\\pIf your POKéDEX has complete data\\non {STR_VAR_1} species, I'm supposed to\\lgive you a reward.\\pPROF. OAK entrusted me with the\\n{STR_VAR_2} for you.\\pSo, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\\pHave you gathered data on at least\\n{STR_VAR_1} kinds of POKéMON?$","Route9_Text_AlanRematchIntro":"Hahahaha!\\nI'll win this time!$","Text_AllAboardSeagallopNum":"All right!\\nAll aboard SEAGALLOP HI-SPEED {STR_VAR_1}!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontNeedAnyGrooming":"You don't need any grooming done?\\nOkay, we'll just have tea.$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_AnnIntro":"I collected these POKéMON\\nfrom all around the world!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_DontHaveSpaceForThis":"You don't have space for this in\\nyour BAG.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiDefeat":"Wargh!$","SSAnne_1F_Room6_Text_GladEveryoneIsRefreshed":"I'm glad to see that everyone is\\nlooking refreshed and chipper.$","Route6_Text_ElijahIntro":"I've never seen you around.\\nAre you good?$","Route11_Text_DarianDefeat":"I saw this coming…$","SSAnne_B1F_Room2_Text_HueyPostBattle":"We caught all our POKéMON while\\nwe were out at sea.$","Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem":"…Oh. I see.\\pWhen you get {STR_VAR_1} kinds of POKéMON,\\ncome back for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_HowAreTheFishBiting":"Hello there, {PLAYER}!\\pHow are the fish biting?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_BrockDefeat":"I took you for granted, and so\\nI lost.\\pAs proof of your victory, I confer\\non you this…the official POKéMON\\lLEAGUE BOULDERBADGE.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} received the BOULDERBADGE\\nfrom BROCK!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\\p{FONT_MALE}Just having the BOULDERBADGE makes\\nyour POKéMON more powerful.\\pIt also enables the use of the\\nmove FLASH outside of battle.\\pOf course, a POKéMON must know the\\nmove FLASH to use it.$","Text_PokeMartShelf":"Wow!\\nTons of POKéMON stuff!$","Text_Burglary":"There are obvious signs of burglary\\nhere…$","Text_Food":"It should be packed with all kinds\\nof delicious things to eat.$","Text_Telephone":"It's a telephone.\\nBetter not use it.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakPokedexOnDesk":"On the desk there is my invention,\\nthe POKéDEX!\\pIt automatically records data on\\nPOKéMON you've seen or caught.\\pIt's a high-tech encyclopedia!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_YouWantDomeFossil":"Do you want the DOME FOSSIL?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_GetOldAmberChecked":"Ssh!\\nGet the OLD AMBER checked!$","Route25_Text_MistyHighHopesAboutThisPlace":"This cape is a famous date spot.\\pMISTY, the GYM LEADER, has high\\nhopes about this place.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_LtSurgePostBattle":"A little word of advice, kid!\\pElectricity is sure powerful!\\pBut, it's useless against GROUND-\\ntype POKéMON!$","Route11_Text_EddieDefeat":"Huh?\\nThat's not right!$","Route6_Text_KeigoIntro":"There aren't many bugs out here.$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_YuckShouldntHaveLooked":"Yuck!\\nShouldn't have looked!$","Route11_Text_YasuPostBattle":"There's a fat POKéMON that comes\\ndown from the mountains.\\pI bet it'd be strong if you can\\ncatch it.$","Route9_Text_ChrisIntro":"Who's that walking there with those\\ngood-looking POKéMON?$","Route5_SouthEntrance_Text_ThatTeaLooksTasty":"Oh, that TEA…\\nIt looks awfully tasty…$","Text_GiveNicknameToThisMon":"Do you want to give a nickname to\\nthis {STR_VAR_1}?$","CeruleanCity_Text_OkayIllReturnStolenTM":"…Okay.\\nI'll return the TM I stole.$","Route11_Text_BraxtonDefeat":"That was electric!$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_DuncanIntro":"Come on, then!\\nMy sailor's pride is at stake!$","Text_AccessedProfOaksPC":"Accessed PROF. OAK's PC…\\pAccessed the POKéDEX Rating\\nSystem…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice":"Yo!\\nChamp in the making!\\pEven I don't know the VIRIDIAN\\nLEADER's identity.\\pBut one thing's certain.\\nThis will be the toughest of all\\lthe GYM LEADERS.\\pAlso, I heard that the TRAINERS\\nhere like GROUND-type POKéMON.$","Text_TastyFood":"Oh, that smells tasty!\\nIt might get the stomach growling!$","Route3_Text_RobinIntro":"Eek!\\nDid you touch me?$","Route9_Text_AliciaPostBattle":"The tunnel coming up is pitch-black\\ninside.\\pYou'll need FLASH to get through\\nthere.$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_PrimeBeefsteak":"Prime Beefsteak!\\pBut, have I enough fillets du\\nbeef?$","VermilionCity_Text_WelcomeToTheSSAnne":"Welcome to the S.S. ANNE!$","Text_OhThatsBadgeGoRightAhead":"Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!\\nGo right ahead.$","CeruleanCity_Mart_Text_RepelWorksOnWeakMons":"REPEL not only keeps bugs away,\\nit also works on weak POKéMON.\\pPut your strongest POKéMON at the\\nleft of the POKéMON LIST.\\pIf your first POKéMON is strong,\\nREPEL's effect is boosted.$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_TylerPostBattle":"Listen, listen!\\nLet me be your friend, okay?\\pThen we can trade POKéMON and\\ndo stuff.$","Text_WelcomeWantToHealPkmn":"Welcome to our POKéMON CENTER!\\pWould you like me to heal your\\nPOKéMON back to perfect health?$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_DuncanPostBattle":"Did you see the FISHING GURU in\\nVERMILION CITY?$","Route25_Text_KelseyPostBattle":"I wish my boyfriend was as good\\nas you.$","CeruleanCity_Text_MakeRoomForThisCantRun":"Make room for this!\\nI can't run until I give it to you!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisDefeat":"I lost?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TeamRocketMtMoonImOnPhone":"What!?\\pTEAM ROCKET is at MT. MOON?\\nHuh?\\pI'm on the phone!\\nScram!$","Route4_Text_TrippedOverGeodude":"Ouch! I tripped over a rocky\\nPOKéMON, GEODUDE!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MarcosPostBattle":"Kids like you shouldn't be\\nwandering around here in the dark.$","ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons":"You want to know about the two\\nkinds of caterpillar POKéMON?$","Route5_Text_UndergroundPathSign":"UNDERGROUND PATH\\nCERULEAN CITY - VERMILION CITY$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_ObeyLv50Strength":"POKéMON up to Lv. 50 will obey\\nyou.\\pThat includes even outsiders you\\nobtain in trades.\\pPOKéMON of higher levels will\\nbe unruly in battle, however.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nSTRENGTH outside of battle.$","Route9_Text_BriceIntro":"Hahaha!\\nAren't you a little toughie!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_ComeVisitAnytime":"Come visit me anytime you wish.$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_ThankYouComeAgain":"Thank you!\\nCome back again sometime!$","Text_WouldYouLikeToMixRecords":"Would you like to mix records with\\nother TRAINERS?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AmberIsFossilizedSap":"AMBER is actually sap, that gooey\\nstuff that oozes from trees.\\pThe ancient sap fossilized over\\ntime to become rock-hard AMBER.$","Text_OnlyPassWithBadgeDontHaveYet":"You can pass here only if you have\\nthe {STR_VAR_1}.\\pYou don't have the {STR_VAR_1}\\nyet.\\pYou have to have it to get to\\nthe POKéMON LEAGUE.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaPostBattle":"You have to face other TRAINERS\\nto see how good you really are.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalReceivedMonFromOak":"{RIVAL} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","Route3_Text_ColtonDefeat":"You beat me again!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedFivePokeBalls":"{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS.$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_AnnPostBattle":"You hurt my poor POKéMON!\\pI demand that you heal them at a\\nPOKéMON CENTER!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ThanksLadyTakeThis":"BILL: Yeehah!\\nThanks, lady! I owe you one!\\pSo, did you come to see my\\nPOKéMON collection?\\pYou didn't?\\nThat's a bummer.\\pI've got to thank you…\\nOh, here, maybe this'll do.$","ViridianForest_Text_WeakenMonsBeforeCapture":"TRAINER TIPS\\pWeaken POKéMON before attempting\\ncapture!\\pWhen healthy, they may escape!$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_ImFishingGuruDoYouLikeToFish":"I'm the FISHING GURU!\\pI simply looove fishing!\\nI can't bear to go without.\\pTell me, do you like to fish?$","ViridianCity_School_Text_ExplainFreeze":"A frozen POKéMON becomes\\nhelplessly immobile.\\pIt stays frozen even after the\\nbattle ends.\\pUse ICE HEAL to thaw out the\\nsuffering POKéMON.$","Route11_Text_DaveRematchIntro":"I raised my POKéMON carefully.\\nThey should be ready by now.\\lThis time, they should win, too.$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle":"POKéMON lived here long before\\npeople came.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_SomeoneBragsBragBack":"If someone brags, brag right back!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_BlankEncyclopedia":"It's like an encyclopedia, but the\\npages are blank.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanPostBattle":"I have to find stronger POKéMON.\\nWhere might they be?$","Trade_Text_Thanks":"Thanks!$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_ThanksForSpreadingNewsTakeThis":"Ah, you've spread the news for me?\\pGood news becomes worthwhile when\\nall sorts of people share it.\\pAs my thanks for your spreading\\nthe news, take this!$","Route11_Text_YasuDefeat":"Darn!\\nMy POKéMON need to be stronger!$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PoisonedMonFaintedWhileWalking":"My POKéMON was poisoned!\\nIt fainted while we were walking!$","CableClub_Text_WelcomeWhichDirectCornerRoom":"Welcome to the POKéMON WIRELESS\\nCLUB DIRECT CORNER.\\pYou may interact directly with\\nyour friends here.\\pWhich room would you like to\\nenter?$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ErrandForGrandpaThisWillHelp":"Grandpa asked you to run an\\nerrand?\\pGee, that's lazy of him.\\nHere, this will help you.$","SSAnne_1F_Corridor_Text_LeStrongSilentType":"Bonjour!\\nI am le waiter on this ship!\\pI will be happy to serve you\\nanything you please!\\p… … …\\nAh! Le strong silent type!$","Route11_Text_BraxtonRematchIntro":"Hi, there!\\pBut be careful!\\nI'm still laying down some cables!$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WhenJiggylypuffSingsMonsGetDrowsy":"Yawn!\\pWhen JIGGLYPUFF sings, POKéMON get\\ndrowsy…\\p…Me, too…\\nSnore…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenDefeat":"I lost my grip!$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_ScrubbingDecksHardWork":"Whew!\\nScrubbing decks is hard work!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_NotebookFirstPage":"Let's check out the notebook.\\pFirst page…\\pPOKé BALLS are used to catch\\nPOKéMON.\\pUp to six POKéMON can be carried\\nin your party.\\pPeople who raise and battle\\nwith POKéMON are called TRAINERS.$","Route9_Text_ConnerDefeat":"My bugs…$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ChairmansStory":"Good!\\nThen listen up!\\pMy favorite RAPIDASH…\\pIt's…cute…lovely…smart… \\nplus…amazing…you think so?…\\loh yes…it's…stunning…\\lkindly…love it!\\pHug it…when…sleeping…warm\\nand cuddly…spectacular…\\lravishing…\\l…Oops! Look at the time!\\lI kept you too long!\\pThanks for hearing me out!\\nI want you to have this!$","CableClub_Text_AskAboutLinking":"Hello, {PLAYER}!\\pIt's me, TEALA, the POKéMON\\nCENTER 2F attendant.\\pIs there something you needed to\\nask me about linking?$","SSAnne_B1F_Room3_Text_DylanPostBattle":"Sea POKéMON live in deep water.\\nYou'll need a ROD to fish them up!$","Route2_Text_DiglettsCave":"DIGLETT'S CAVE$","Text_DecidedNotTo":"Oh, you've decided not to?\\nYou're fickle, aren't you?$","ViridianForest_Text_DougPostBattle":"That totally stinks! I'm going to\\ncatch some stronger ones!$","Route25_Text_FlintRematchIntro":"I'm a cool guy.\\nI've got a girlfriend!\\pI'll show her how cool I am for\\nsure this time!$","Route21_North_Text_WadePostBattle":"I seem to only catch MAGIKARP!$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_DawnIntro":"I don't believe I saw you at the\\nparty?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_TryDifferentPartyOrders":"The first POKéMON out in a match is\\nat the left of the POKéMON LIST.\\pBy changing the order of POKéMON,\\nyou may gain an advantage.\\pTry different orders to suit your\\nopponent's party.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_SpaceShuttle":"Space Shuttle$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColeDefeat":"Yowch!\\nWhiplash!$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_SorryYouCantAffordIt":"Sorry!\\nYou can't afford it!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat":"I blew it!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_HiBrothersAtLab":"DAISY: Hi, {PLAYER}!\\pMy brother, {RIVAL}, is out at\\nGrandpa's LAB.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ReceivedBikeVoucherFromChairman":"{PLAYER} received a BIKE VOUCHER\\nfrom the CHAIRMAN.$","Route21_North_Text_RonaldPostBattle":"I can't catch anything good.\\nNot one good POKéMON to be had!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_LabOnCinnabarRegeneratesFossils":"Far away, on CINNABAR ISLAND,\\nthere's a POKéMON LAB.\\pThey do research on regenerating\\nfossils.$","Route25_Text_WayneRematchIntro":"You're going to see BILL again?\\nFirst, we battle!$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_SayHiToOakForMe":"Okay, thanks! Please say hi to\\nPROF. OAK for me, too.$","UndergroundPath_SouthEntrance_Text_PeopleLoseThingsInTheDarkness":"People often lose things in the\\ndarkness of the UNDERGROUND PATH.$","Route25_Text_JoeyDefeat":"You're decent.$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_BigMonAsleepOnRoad":"Let's see what the binoculars have\\nto show…\\pA big POKéMON is asleep on a road!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_WhyMustYouLieNoBerries":"Why must you lie to me?\\pHow many BERRIES do you have?\\nNot a one!$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ExplainCut":"Using CUT, you can chop down\\nsmall trees.\\pWhy not try it with the trees\\naround VERMILION CITY?$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonPostBattle":"Do you know the identity of our\\nGYM LEADER?$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_BarnyDefeat":"Darn!\\nI let that one get away!$","SSAnne_2F_Corridor_Text_RivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: Bonjour!\\n{PLAYER}!\\pImagine seeing you here!\\n{PLAYER}, were you really invited?\\pSo how's your POKéDEX coming?\\pI already caught 40 kinds, pal.\\nDifferent kinds are everywhere.\\pCrawl around in grassy areas, and\\nlook hard for them.$","Route9_Text_CaitlinPostBattle":"You're obviously talented.\\nGood luck to you!$","Text_HavePokedexRated":"Would you like to have your\\nPOKéDEX rated?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM39FromBrock":"{PLAYER} received TM39\\nfrom BROCK.$","SSAnne_1F_Room6_Text_TakeAShortRest":"You look tired. Would you like to\\ntake a short rest?$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_TrevorIntro":"Ahoy, there!\\nAre you seasick?$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_ObtainedDomeFossil":"Obtained the DOME FOSSIL!$","SSAnne_1F_Room6_Text_SorryYouLookLikeMySister":"Oh, I'm sorry for fussing over you.\\nYou look like my little sister…$","Route4_Text_MtMoonEntrance":"MT. MOON\\nTunnel Entrance$","Route21_North_Text_IanPostBattle":"IAN: Come on, Sis!\\pYou're not going to lose weight\\nlike this!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakExplainCatching":"When a wild POKéMON appears,\\nit's fair game.\\pJust throw a POKé BALL at it and\\ntry to catch it!\\pThis won't always work, however.\\pA healthy POKéMON can escape.\\nYou have to be lucky!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_CheckOutRareMonsOnPC":"BILL: Feel like checking out some\\nof my rare POKéMON on my PC?\\pGo on, check out my PC.$","Route25_Text_WaynePostBattle":"The trail below is a shortcut to\\nCERULEAN CITY.$","PewterCity_Text_RunningShoesLetterFromMom":"There's a letter attached…\\pDear {PLAYER},\\pHere is a pair of RUNNING SHOES\\nfor my beloved challenger.\\pRemember, I'll always cheer for\\nyou! Don't ever give up!\\pFrom Mom$","PewterCity_Text_ReallyYouHaveToGo":"Really?\\nYou absolutely have to go!$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyDefeat":"Wow!\\nYou're too much!\\pAll right!\\pYou can have the CASCADEBADGE to\\nshow you beat me.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_RunningSpaceExhibitThisMonth":"This month, we're running a space\\nexhibit.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SweetieBuyMagikarpForJust500":"MAN: Hello there, sweetie pie!\\nHave I got a deal just for you!\\pI'll let you have a secret POKéMON\\n- a MAGIKARP - for just ¥500!\\pSo, you'll buy it, am I right?$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerPostBattle":"The sea is great and all, but I\\nlike the mountains, too.$","PewterCity_Text_DoYouKnowWhatImDoing":"Psssst!\\nDo you know what I'm doing?$","CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerLifeIsToughIsntIt":"You're a TRAINER, too?\\pCollecting, battling…\\nIt's a tough life, isn't it?$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LetMeTakeYouToTheTop":"Hiya!\\nDo you want to dream big?\\pDo you dare to dream of becoming\\nthe POKéMON champ?\\pI'm no TRAINER, but I can advise\\nyou on how to win.\\pLet me take you to the top!$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_CruisingAroundWorld":"We are cruising around the world,\\nmy children and I.$","SSAnne_1F_Room2_Text_AnnDefeat":"Oh, no!\\nI went around the world for these!$","SSAnne_B1F_Room1_Text_BarnyPostBattle":"I was going to make you my\\nassistant, too!$","CeruleanCity_Text_PeopleHereWereRobbed":"The people here were robbed.\\pIt's obvious that TEAM ROCKET is\\nbehind this most heinous crime!\\pEven our POLICE FORCE has\\ntrouble with the ROCKETS!$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_AllGirlsLeaveOakLookingForYou":"MOM: …Right.\\nAll girls dream of traveling.\\lIt said so on TV.\\pOh, yes. PROF. OAK, next door, was\\nlooking for you.$","VermilionCity_Text_BuildingOnThisLand":"I'm putting up a building on this\\nplot of land. I own it all.\\pMy POKéMON is tamping the land\\nto lay the foundation.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DeliveredOaksParcel":"{PLAYER} delivered OAK'S PARCEL.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: ?\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonIntro":"POKéMON and I, we make wonderful\\nmusic together!$","Text_Blueprints":"It's a blueprint of some sort.\\nIt's filled with diagrams and text.$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerDefeat":"Ayah!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat":"Urgh!\\nNow I'm mad!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenPostBattle":"The LEADER will scold me for\\nlosing this way…$","Route11_Text_JasperPostBattle":"You can't be a coward in the world\\nof POKéMON!$","Route6_Text_NancyPostBattle":"Whisper…\\nWhisper…$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshDefeat":"Losing stinks!\\nIt's so uncool.$","VermilionCity_Text_MachopStompingLandFlat":"A MACHOP is stomping the land flat.$","ViridianForest_Text_CharlieIntro":"Did you know that POKéMON evolve?$","Route9_Text_BriceDefeat":"What's that?$","Route11_Text_DarianIntro":"I have never won before…$","Route3_Text_ColtonPostBattle":"There are other kinds of POKéMON\\nthan the ones you find in forests.$","Text_AccessWhichPC":"Which PC should be accessed?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNowTheseUnitsCanRecordMoreData":"… … …  … … …\\p… … …  … … …\\p…And that's done!\\pNow these units can record data on\\na lot more POKéMON.$","Text_OpenedPkmnStorage":"POKéMON Storage System opened.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyPostBattle":"Okay, I'll talk!\\pLT. SURGE said he hid door\\nswitches inside something.$","Route11_Text_DarianPostBattle":"I was unlucky, as always.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_LiamDefeat":"Darn!\\pLight-years isn't time…\\nIt measures distance!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerDefeat":"Stop!\\nYou're very good!$","ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally":"I go shopping in PEWTER CITY\\noccasionally.\\pI have to take the winding trail in\\nVIRIDIAN FOREST when I go.$","SSAnne_2F_Room5_Text_WeThinkSafariZoneIsAwesome":"Me and my daddy think the SAFARI\\nZONE is awesome!\\lI wish we could go there again.$","Route25_Text_ChadDefeat":"I knew I'd lose, too!$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureProfOak":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PROF. OAK,\\nthe POKéMON Researcher!\\pPROF. OAK reportedly lives with his\\ngrandchildren DAISY and {RIVAL}.$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_YourBerryPouchIsFull":"Hm? Your BERRY POUCH is full.\\nMy gift remains ungiven, then.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllCompleteThePokedex":"{RIVAL}: Gramps, calm down.\\nDon't get so excited.\\pI'll get the POKéDEX completed,\\ndon't you worry about a thing.\\pI think I'll try looking around\\nONE ISLAND first…\\pAnyways, I'm outta here!$","PokedexRating_Text_HowIsPokedexComingAlong":"OAK: Good to see you!\\nHow is your POKéDEX coming along?\\pHere, let me take a look.$","CableClub_Text_TrainerCardDataOverwritten":"The TRAINER CARD data will\\nbe overwritten.$","Route6_Text_RickyPostBattle":"Whisper…\\nWhisper…$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_WarrenIntro":"The truly talented win with style.$","SSAnne_Deck_Text_EdmondPostBattle":"How many kinds of POKéMON do you\\nthink there are in this big world?$","Text_MonUsedMove":"{STR_VAR_1} used {STR_VAR_2}!$","CeruleanCity_Text_ThisIsCeruleanCave":"This is CERULEAN CAVE.\\pHorribly strong POKéMON live inside\\nthere.\\pIt takes a very special TRAINER to\\nbe allowed inside there.\\pYou'd have to be strong enough to\\nbecome the POKéMON LEAGUE\\lCHAMPION for starters.\\pAnd, you would have to have\\nmade a great achievement.$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroLoafingAround":"SLOWBRO is loafing around…$","Text_TellMeWhatsYourProfile":"Tell me something good about\\nyourself. What's your profile?$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalIntro":"{RIVAL}: Hey! {PLAYER}!\\pYou're off to the POKéMON LEAGUE?\\nForget about it!\\pYou probably don't have any\\nBADGES, do you?\\pThe guard won't let you through\\nwithout them.\\pBy the way, did your POKéMON get\\nany stronger?$","Route3_Text_GregDefeat":"If I had new POKéMON, I would've\\nwon!$","Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem":"Oh! I see you don't have any\\nroom for the {STR_VAR_2}.$","Route25_Text_NobIntro":"I'm off to see a POKéMANIAC's\\ncollection at the cape.$","Text_PolishedWindow":"The window is very well polished.$","Route9_Text_JeremyIntro":"Bwahaha!\\nGreat! I was bored, eh!$","Route6_NorthEntrance_Text_ThanksIllShareTeaWithGuards":"Huh? I can have this drink?\\nGee, thanks!\\l… …\\lGlug, glug…\\l… …\\lGulp…\\lIf you want to go to SAFFRON\\lCITY…\\l… …\\lYou can go on through.\\pI'll share this TEA with the other\\nguards!$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_OhThatsSoDisappointing":"Oh…\\nThat's so disappointing…$","SSAnne_B1F_Room4_Text_LeonardPostBattle":"Hahaha!\\nWant to be a sailor, mate?$","Route23_Text_VictoryRoadGateSign":"VICTORY ROAD GATE -\\nPOKéMON LEAGUE$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_SamuelDefeat":"I was beaten?$","PalletTown_PlayersHouse_1F_Text_YouShouldTakeQuickRest":"MOM: {PLAYER}!\\nYou should take a quick rest.$","ViridianCity_House_Text_NicknamingIsFun":"Coming up with nicknames is fun,\\nbut it's not so easy to do.\\pClever names are nice, but simple\\nnames are easier to remember.$","PewterCity_Text_ReceivedRunningShoesFromAide":"{PLAYER} received the\\nRUNNING SHOES from the AIDE.$","Route3_Text_SallyIntro":"That look you gave me…\\nIt's so intriguing!$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_LamarPostBattle":"Personally, I prefer strong and\\nrare POKéMON.$","Text_MonSentToBoxBillsBoxFull":"BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\\nBILL'S PC was full.\\p{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_Right50YThankYou":"Right, ¥50!\\nThank you!$","Route6_Text_NancyRematchIntro":"Excuse me! Didn't I tell you that\\nthis is a private conversation?\\pYou shouldn't be listening in,\\nyou uncouth person!$","CeruleanCity_Text_WantBrightRedBicycle":"I want a bright red bicycle.\\pI'll keep it at home, so it won't\\nget dirty.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCatchMonsForDataTakeThese":"OAK: You can't get detailed data\\non POKéMON by just seeing them.\\pYou must catch them to obtain\\ncomplete data.\\pSo, here are some tools for\\ncatching wild POKéMON.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM26FromGiovanni":"{PLAYER} received TM26\\nfrom GIOVANNI.$","CeruleanCity_House2_Text_TeachDiglettDigWithoutTM":"I figure what's lost is lost.\\pI decided to teach DIGLETT how to\\nDIG without a TM.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_DidYouComeToHearAboutMyMons":"I chair the POKéMON Fan Club!\\pI raise more than a hundred\\nPOKéMON!\\pI'm very fussy when it comes to\\nPOKéMON! I surely am!\\pSo…\\pDid you come visit to hear about\\nmy POKéMON?$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_NoPleaseBeautiful":"No!?\\nNow don't be so cold!\\pCome on, you gotta help a guy in\\ndeep, deep trouble!\\pWhat do you say, beautiful?\\nPlease?\\lOkay?\\lAll right!$","Route24_Text_AliRematchIntro":"The time we battled…\\pEven though I was the second in\\nline, I was the best, wasn't I?$","Route25_Text_FranklinIntro":"I just got down from MT. MOON,\\nbut I've still got gas in the tank!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_JasonDefeat":"You are in perfect harmony!$","Text_MegaPunchTeach":"A punch of roaring ferocity!\\pPacked with destructive power!\\pWhen the chips are down,\\nMEGA PUNCH is the ultimate attack!\\lYou agree, yes?\\pNow!\\nLet me teach it to your POKéMON!$","Route25_Text_DanIntro":"Dad took me to a great party on\\nthe S.S. ANNE at VERMILION CITY.$","CeruleanCity_Text_YouCanCutDownSmallTrees":"Did you know that you can CUT down\\nsmall trees?\\pEven that small tree in front of\\nthe shop can be CUT down.\\pI think there's a way around it,\\nthough.$","Route11_Text_EddieIntro":"Let's go, but don't cheat!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakWhichOneWillYouChoose":"OAK: Now, {PLAYER}.\\pInside those three POKé BALLS are\\nPOKéMON.\\pWhich one will you choose for\\nyourself?$","Route25_Text_FranklinRematchIntro":"I just trained up on MT. MOON,\\nbut I've still got gas in the tank!$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_ExplainHM05":"HM05 contains the hidden move\\nFLASH.\\pFLASH lights up even the darkest\\nof caves and dungeons.$","Route6_NorthEntrance_Text_ThatTeaLooksTasty":"Oh, that TEA…\\nIt looks awfully tasty…$","CableClub_Text_IncorrectNumberOfParticipants":"The number of participants is\\nincorrect.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisIntro":"What?\\nI'm waiting for my friends to find\\lme here.$","CeruleanCity_Text_ExplainFameCheckerSmellYa":"A chatty gossip like you…\\nThat thing's perfect.\\pI don't need it because I don't\\ngive a hoot about others.\\pAll right, this time I really am\\ngone. Smell ya!$","PalletTown_Text_RaisingMonsToo":"I'm raising POKéMON, too.\\pWhen they get strong, they can\\nprotect me.$","Text_RivalVictory":"{RIVAL}: Yeah!\\nAm I great or what?$","SSAnne_1F_Room7_Text_ThomasPostBattle":"You should be nice to friends!$","VermilionCity_House2_Text_DoYouHaveMonWantToTradeForMyMon":"Hi!\\nDo you have a {STR_VAR_1}?\\pWant to trade it for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$","Route24_Text_ShaneIntro":"I saw your feat from the grass!$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainCascadeBadge":"The CASCADEBADGE makes all\\nPOKéMON up to Lv. 30 obey.\\pThat includes even outsiders you\\ngot in trades.\\pThere's more. You can now use CUT\\nanytime, even out of battle.\\pYou can CUT down small trees to\\nopen new pathways.\\pYou can also have my favorite TM.$","Route24_Text_CaleIntro":"People call this the NUGGET\\nBRIDGE!\\pBeat us five TRAINERS and win\\na fabulous prize!\\pThink you got what it takes?$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_MakeRoomForBicycle":"You better make room for your\\nBICYCLE!$","PalletTown_Text_CanStoreItemsAndMonsInPC":"Technology is incredible!\\pYou can now store and recall items\\nand POKéMON as data via PC.$","Trade_Text_AwwOhWell":"Awww!\\nOh, well…$","Route11_Text_BernieRematchIntro":"Keep your eyes out for live wires!$","Route9_Text_BrentDefeat":"WHAT?\\pWhat a total waste of time!$","ViridianForest_Text_DougDefeat":"Huh?\\nI ran out of POKéMON!$","PalletTown_Text_OhLookLook":"Oh!\\nLook, look!$","Route9_Text_AlanPostBattle":"Hahahaha!\\nUs hearty guys always laugh!$","Route9_Text_DrewIntro":"I'm taking the ROCK TUNNEL to\\ngo to LAVENDER…$","Text_MegaPunchTaught":"Now, we are comrades in the way of\\npunching!\\pYou should go before you're seen\\nby the misguided fool who trains\\lonly his silly kicking over there.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_IrisPostBattle":"I came because I heard there are\\nsome very rare fossils here.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room2_Text_HueyDefeat":"Okay, you're not bad.$","PewterCity_Text_BrocksLookingForChallengersFollowMe":"You're a TRAINER, right?\\pBROCK's looking for new\\nchallengers. Follow me!$","ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pBut I made it too strong.\\nIt gave me a headache…\\pIncidentally, is my old TEACHY TV\\nhelping you?$","Route3_Text_BenDefeat":"I don't believe it!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ImBillHelpMeOutPal":"Hiya! I'm a POKéMON…\\n…No I'm not!\\pCall me BILL!\\nI'm a true-blue POKéMANIAC!\\pHey!\\nWhat's with that skeptical look?\\pI'm not joshing you, pal.\\pI screwed up an experiment and got\\ncombined with a POKéMON!\\pSo, how about it?\\nHelp me out here!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_MayISeeFirstMon":"DAISY: Your POKéMON grow to love\\nyou if you raise them with love.\\pFor example, {PLAYER}, may I see\\nyour first POKéMON?$","Text_DontBeLikeThat":"Aww… Don't be like that.\\nYou can tell me your profile.$","Route4_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NoRoomForMorePokemon":"There's no more room for any more\\nPOKéMON, it looks like.$","VermilionCity_Text_Seagallop10Departing":"Okay, everything's in order for you\\nto board a special ferry.\\pSEAGALLOP HI-SPEED 10 will be\\ndeparting immediately.$","Text_FoundTMHMContainsMove":"{PLAYER} found a {STR_VAR_2}!\\nIt contains {STR_VAR_1}.$","Text_ChangeYourProfile":"Would you like to change your\\nprofile?$","ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyDefeat":"Oh, boo.\\nNothing went right.$","VermilionCity_Mart_Text_TeamRocketAreWickedPeople":"There are wicked people who will\\nuse POKéMON for criminal acts.\\pTEAM ROCKET traffics in rare\\nPOKéMON, for example.\\pThey also abandon POKéMON that\\nthey consider unpopular or useless.\\pThat's the sort of horrid people\\nthey are, TEAM ROCKET.$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_ColePostBattle":"Wait!\\nI was just careless!$","CableClub_Text_PleaseConfirmNumberAndRestart":"Please confirm the number of\\nplayers and start again.$","CeruleanCity_Text_CitySign":"CERULEAN CITY\\nA Mysterious, Blue Aura Surrounds\\lIt$","SSAnne_B1F_Room2_Text_HueyIntro":"Even us sailors have POKéMON, too!$","CeruleanCity_Text_HardToControlMonsObedience":"No! That's wrong!\\nIt's so hard to control POKéMON!\\pYour POKéMON's obedience depends\\non your abilities as a TRAINER.$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_NoPleaseChief":"No!?\\nNow don't be so cold!\\pCome on, you gotta help a guy in\\ndeep, deep trouble!\\pWhat do you say, chief?\\nPlease?\\lOkay?\\lAll right!$","Trade_Text_WellIfYouDontWantTo":"Well, if you don't want to…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_AllMonTypesHaveStrongAndWeakPoints":"All POKéMON types have strong and\\nweak points against others.$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroTurnedAway":"SLOWBRO turned away…$","SSAnne_1F_Room4_Text_WaitressCherryPiePlease":"Waitress, I would like a cherry\\npie, please!$","PokedexRating_Text_SeenXOwnedY":"The amount of progress you've made\\non your POKéDEX is:\\p{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\\n{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\\p{FONT_NORMAL}PROF. OAK's rating:$","Route21_North_Text_SpencerIntro":"The sea cleanses my body and soul!$","PalletTown_Text_LookCopiedTrainerTipsSign":"Look, look!\\pI copied what it said on one of\\nthose TRAINER TIPS signs!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_SeeWhichMon":"Which POKéMON do you want to see?$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGrampsIsntAround":"{RIVAL}: What, it's only {PLAYER}?\\nGramps isn't around.$","SSAnne_1F_Room4_Text_WaiterCherryPiePlease":"Waiter, I would like a cherry pie,\\nplease!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BoughtColorTVForMoonLanding":"July 20, 1969!\\pHumankind first set foot on the\\nmoon that day.\\pI bought a color TV just so I\\ncould watch that news.$","Text_MegaKickDeclined":"You'll come crawling back when you\\nrealize the value of MEGA KICK.$","Route6_Text_IsabelleRematchIntro":"Me?\\nWell, okay. I'll play this once.$","Route25_Text_ChadRematchIntro":"I had this feeling…\\nI knew I had to battle you again!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBePatientRival":"OAK: Be patient, {RIVAL}.\\nYou can have one, too!$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaDefeat":"You overwhelmed me!$","VermilionCity_Text_CitySign":"VERMILION CITY\\nThe Port of Exquisite Sunsets$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WeHaveTwoFossilsOnExhibit":"We have two fossils of rare,\\nprehistoric POKéMON on exhibit.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_YoureChampMaterial":"Just as I thought!\\nYou're POKéMON champ material!$","Route11_Text_DaveIntro":"I raised my POKéMON carefully.\\nThey should be ready by now!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ShelvesCrammedFullOfBooks":"The shelves are crammed full of\\nbooks on POKéMON.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM39":"A TM, Technical Machine, contains a\\ntechnique for POKéMON.\\pUsing a TM teaches the move it\\ncontains to a POKéMON.\\pA TM is good for only one use.\\pSo, when you use one, pick the\\nPOKéMON carefully.\\pAnyways…\\nTM39 contains ROCK TOMB.\\pIt hurls boulders at the foe and\\nlowers its SPEED.$","Route25_Text_DanPostBattle":"On the S.S. ANNE, I saw TRAINERS\\nfrom around the world.$","VermilionCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_SeelFarMoreAttractive":"Oh, dear!\\pMy SEEL is far more attractive.\\nBy double, I would say.$","Trade_Text_LookingForMonWannaTradeForMon":"I'm looking for the POKéMON\\n{STR_VAR_1}!\\pWanna trade one for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3Defeat":"So, you are good…$","VermilionCity_House3_Text_DearPippiLetter":"Dear PIPPI,\\nI hope to see you soon.\\pI heard SAFFRON has problems with\\nTEAM ROCKET.\\pVERMILION appears to be safe.$","Text_NeatlyLinedUpTools":"All sorts of tools are lined up\\nneatly.$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_BusyOutOfTheWay":"You, mon petit!\\nWe're busy here!\\lOut of the way!$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_WhatABreathtakingView":"Let's see what the binoculars have\\nto show…\\pWhat a breathtaking view!$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureMisty":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: CERULEAN GYM\\nLEADER MISTY!\\pMISTY is said to worship LORELEI\\nof the ELITE FOUR.$","Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_ForestIsMaze":"Are you going to VIRIDIAN FOREST?\\nIt's a natural maze in there.\\lBe careful you don't get lost.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_SecondLockOpened":"The second electric lock opened!\\nThe motorized door opened!$","CableClub_Text_NoEnigmaBerryInUnionRoom":"No POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY may enter the UNION ROOM.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisPostBattle":"MISTY is a TRAINER who's going to\\nkeep improving.\\pShe won't lose to someone like you!$","Route6_Text_JeffPostBattle":"I should bring more POKéMON with\\nme. I'll feel safer that way.$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_OweMeXForMonsReturn":"You owe me ¥{STR_VAR_2} for the return\\nof this POKéMON.$","SSAnne_2F_Room4_Text_DawnPostBattle":"Oh, I adore your strong POKéMON!\\nOh, how I envy you for them!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_ObeyLv30Cut":"POKéMON up to Lv. 30 will obey\\nyou.\\pThat includes even outsiders you\\nobtain in trades.\\pPOKéMON of higher levels will\\nbe unruly in battle, however.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nCUT outside of battle.$","Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCutSkinnyTrees":"Have you noticed the skinny trees\\non the roadside?\\pThey can be cut down by a special\\nPOKéMON move, I hear.$","SSAnne_B1F_Room5_Text_MachokeHasStrengthToMoveRocks":"My buddy MACHOKE is super strong!\\pHe has enough STRENGTH to move\\nbig rocks!$","Route9_Text_ChrisDefeat":"Out like a light!$","VermilionCity_Text_DontHaveNeededSSTicket":"{FONT_NORMAL}{PLAYER} doesn't have the needed\\nS.S. TICKET.\\p{FONT_MALE}Sorry!\\pYou need a ticket to get aboard.$","Route9_Text_BrentIntro":"I got up early every day to raise\\nmy POKéMON from cocoons!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_KentIntro":"Suspicious men are in the cave.\\nWhat about you?$","Route24_Text_AliDefeat":"How could I lose?$","VermilionCity_Text_Route2AideHasPackageForYou":"Oh, hello, {PLAYER}!\\nHow are you doing?\\pIt's me, one of PROF. OAK's AIDES.\\pDid you meet the other AIDE?\\pHe had a package from PROF. OAK\\nfor you, {PLAYER}.\\pHe said he'd look for you around\\nROUTE 2, {PLAYER}.\\pIf you're in the ROUTE 2 area,\\nplease look for him.$","Route2_EastBuilding_Text_CanGetThroughRockTunnel":"Once a POKéMON learns FLASH, you\\ncan get through ROCK TUNNEL.$","PewterCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"PEWTER POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: BROCK\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalMyMonLooksTougher":"{RIVAL}: My POKéMON looks a lot\\ntougher than yours.$","Route9_Text_DrewPostBattle":"Are you off to ROCK TUNNEL, too?$","Route3_Text_GregIntro":"Are you a TRAINER?\\nLet's get with it right away!$","CableClub_Text_NeedFourPlayers":"There must be four players to play\\nthis Battle Mode.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLeaveItToMeGramps":"{RIVAL}: All right, Gramps!\\nLeave it all to me!$","Text_PlayerBootedUpPC":"{PLAYER} booted up the PC.$","PewterCity_Text_OhPlayer":"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$","Text_LikeProfileWayItIs":"Okay, you like your profile the\\nway it is.\\pI think so, too.$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedPokedexFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX\\nfrom PROF. OAK.$","CeruleanCity_Text_BetterGetMovingBye":"I better get moving!\\nBye!$","Text_MegaKickTaught":"Now, we are soul mates in the way\\nof kicking!\\pYou should run before you're seen\\nby the deluded nitwit who trains\\lonly simple punching over there.$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainerMonsStrongerThanWild":"Even if they are the same level,\\nPOKéMON can have very different\\lstats and abilities.\\pA POKéMON raised by a TRAINER is\\nstronger than one in the wild.$","Text_TreeCanBeCutDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!$","Route2_Text_RouteSign":"ROUTE 2\\nVIRIDIAN CITY - PEWTER CITY$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_WelcomeToBikeShop":"Hi!\\nWelcome to our BIKE SHOP.\\pHave we got just the BIKE for\\nyou!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMustReallyWorkToFillPokedex":"Now, {PLAYER} and {RIVAL}!\\pThis time, you really must work\\ntowards filling your POKéDEXES.\\pI urge you to make them the best\\nand the most complete of all time!\\pTruly, this is a monumentally great\\nundertaking in POKéMON history!$","Route24_Text_AliIntro":"I'm second!\\nNow it's serious!$","Route6_Text_RickyRematchIntro":"Oh! You're that nosy kid who\\neavesdropped on us!$","Route11_Text_EddiePostBattle":"I did my best.\\nI have no regrets.$","ViridianCity_Mart_Text_ReceivedOaksParcelFromClerk":"{PLAYER} received OAK'S PARCEL\\nfrom the POKéMON MART clerk.$","CeruleanCity_Text_OhRightLittlePresentAsFavor":"Oh, yeah, right.\\pI feel sorry for you. No, really.\\nYou're always plodding behind me.\\pSo here, I'll give you a little\\npresent as a favor.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisIntro":"Splash!\\pI'm first up!\\nLet's do it!$","ViridianCity_School_Text_BlackboardListsStatusProblems":"The blackboard lists POKéMON\\nSTATUS problems during battles.$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_RunCellSeparationOnPC":"Wait till I get inside the\\nTELEPORTER.\\pWhen I do, go to my PC and run\\nthe Cell Separation System.$","Route4_Text_PeopleLikeAndRespectBrock":"Oh, wow, that's the BOULDERBADGE!\\nYou got it from BROCK, didn't you?\\pBROCK is cool. He's not just tough.\\nPeople like and respect him.\\pI want to become a GYM LEADER\\nlike him.$","ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere":"Those POKé BALLS at your waist!\\nYou have POKéMON, don't you?\\pIt's great that you can carry and\\nuse POKéMON anytime, anywhere.$","PokedexRating_Text_LoveSeeingYourPokedex":"OAK: Ah, welcome!\\pTell me, how is your POKéDEX\\ncoming along?\\pWahaha!\\pActually, I know how it is, but I\\nlove seeing it anyway!\\pLet's see…$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: MISTY\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UseDeviceForRematches":"Use that device and you'll find\\nTRAINERS looking for a rematch.\\pYou have to charge its battery to\\nuse it, though.$","CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_CityBikeGoodEnoughForMe":"A plain city bike is good enough\\nfor me.\\pAfter all, you can't put a shopping\\nbasket on a mountain bike.$","CableClub_Text_UnionRoomAdapterNotConnected":"This is the POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB\\nUNION ROOM.\\pUnfortunately, your Wireless\\nAdapter is not connected properly.\\pPlease do come again.$","VermilionCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UrgeToBattleSomeoneAgain":"The urge to battle with someone\\nyou've tangled with before…\\pHave you ever had that urge?\\nI'm sure you have.\\pI wanted to battle certain people\\nagain over and over, too.\\pSo, I've been giving these away.\\nPlease, take one!$","Text_AccessedPlayersPC":"Accessed {PLAYER}'s PC.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WhatsSpecialAboutMoonStone":"MOON STONE, huh?\\pWhat's so special about it?\\nLooks like an ordinary rock to me.$","CableClub_Text_SomeoneIsNotReadyToLink":"Someone is not ready to link.\\pPlease come back after everyone\\nhas made preparations.$","CeruleanCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BillCollectsRareMons":"BILL has lots of POKéMON!\\nHe collects rare ones, too!$","Route11_Text_DillonRematchIntro":"I became a TRAINER a while ago.\\nBut, I think I can win.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_PleaseEnjoyYourself":"Please enjoy yourself.$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingMyClefairyForPikachu":"I really want a PIKACHU, so I'm\\ntrading my CLEFAIRY for one.$","ViridianCity_School_Text_TryingToMemorizeNotes":"Whew! I'm trying to memorize all my\\nnotes.$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM34FromLtSurge":"{PLAYER} received TM34\\nfrom LT. SURGE.$","Route24_Text_ReliIntro":"I'm No. 4!\\nGetting tired?$","PewterCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TradingPikachuWithKid":"I'm trading POKéMON with that kid\\nthere.\\pI had two PIKACHU, so I figured\\nI might as well trade one.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_DontHaveEnoughBerryPowder":"Hm? You don't have enough\\nBERRY POWDER.$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ThanksBudTakeThis":"BILL: Yeehah!\\nThanks, bud! I owe you one!\\pSo, did you come to see my\\nPOKéMON collection?\\pYou didn't?\\nThat's a bummer.\\pI've got to thank you…\\nOh, here, maybe this'll do.$","SSAnne_Kitchen_Text_SoBusyImDizzy":"I'm so busy I'm getting dizzy!\\nYou have to give me room here!$","CeruleanCity_House4_Text_EnjoyingMyselfWithAllSortsOfNews":"I'm quite enjoying myself with all\\nsorts of news.\\pYes, I am satisfied!\\nI won't be bored for a while.$","CeruleanCity_Text_SlowbroTookSnooze":"SLOWBRO took a snooze…$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsLearnTechniquesAsTheyGrow":"POKéMON learn new techniques as\\nthey grow.\\pBut some moves must be taught to\\nthem by people.$","Route11_EastEntrance_1F_Text_RockTunnelToReachLavender":"If you're aiming to reach LAVENDER\\nTOWN, take ROCK TUNNEL.\\pYou can get to ROCK TUNNEL from\\nCERULEAN CITY.$","PalletTown_Text_OakLetMeSeePokedex":"OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou're back, are you?\\pHow much have you filled in your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pMay I see it?\\pLet's see…$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedMonFromOak":"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}\\nfrom PROF. OAK!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItsWarmingUpToYou":"It's warming up to you.\\nTrust must be growing between you.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamPostBattle":"How do you get out of here?\\nIt's so big, I may get lost.$","Route11_Text_BernieIntro":"Watch out for live wires!$","ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle":"I came here with some friends to\\ncatch us some BUG POKéMON!\\pThey're all itching to get into\\nsome POKéMON battles!$","Route25_SeaCottage_Text_ImBillHelpMeOutLady":"Hiya! I'm a POKéMON…\\n…No I'm not!\\pCall me BILL!\\nI'm a true-blue POKéMANIAC!\\pHey!\\nWhat's with that skeptical look?\\pI'm not joshing you, lady.\\pI screwed up an experiment and got\\ncombined with a POKéMON!\\pSo, how about it?\\nHelp me out here!$","Text_AccessedSomeonesPC":"Accessed Someone's PC.$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JovanIntro":"What!\\nDon't sneak up on me!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_TuckerIntro":"When I was in the Army, LT. SURGE\\nwas my strict CO.\\pHe was a hard taskmaster.$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_AerodactylFossil":"AERODACTYL Fossil\\nA primitive and rare POKéMON.$","SSAnne_1F_Room5_Text_ArthurIntro":"You insolent pup!\\nHow dare you barge in!$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_DaleIntro":"Check out what I fished up!$","SSAnne_3F_Corridor_Text_CaptainTeachesCutToMons":"Our CAPTAIN is a sword master.\\nHe's awesome at using CUT.\\pThey say he even teaches CUT\\nto POKéMON!$","VermilionCity_Text_SSAnneHasDepartedForYear":"So, the S.S. ANNE has departed?\\pShe'll be back in VERMILION about\\nthis time next year.$","Text_MegaPunchWhichMon":"Fine!\\nWhich POKéMON will learn it?$","Route22_Text_EarlyRivalDefeat":"Awww!\\nYou just lucked out!$","PewterCity_Text_ExplainRunningShoes":"Press the B Button to run.\\nBut only where there's room to run!$","Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_ReceivedItemfinderFromAide":"{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_2}\\nfrom the AIDE.$","PewterCity_Mart_Text_GoodThingsIfRaiseMonsDiligently":"Good things can happen if you raise\\nPOKéMON diligently.\\pEven the weak ones can surprise\\nyou if you don't give up on them.$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_AttackStatFlash":"The ATTACK stat of all your\\nPOKéMON increases a little bit.\\pIt also lets you use the move\\nFLASH outside of battle.$","SSAnne_CaptainsOffice_Text_ObtainedHM01FromCaptain":"{PLAYER} obtained HM01\\nfrom the CAPTAIN!$","Text_TrashBin":"Inside this…\\n……\\pThere's nothing here!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon":"VIRIDIAN POKéMON GYM\\nLEADER: GIOVANNI\\pWINNING TRAINERS:\\n{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_AtsushiIntro":"Rrrroar!\\nI'm working myself into a rage!$","Route3_Text_CalvinDefeat":"Lost!\\nLost! Lost!$","CeruleanCity_Text_RivalDefeat":"Hey!\\nTake it easy!\\lYou won already!$","VermilionCity_House1_Text_NoRoomForNiceGift":"Oh, no!\\pI had a nice gift for you, but you\\nhave no room for it!$","Route6_Text_KeigoRematchIntro":"I'm trying to find something good\\nthat's not a BUG POKéMON, but…$","CeruleanCity_House2_Text_TeamRocketTryingToDigIntoNoGood":"TEAM ROCKET must be trying to DIG\\ntheir way into no good!$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ItLooksVeryHappy":"It looks very happy.\\pI wish {RIVAL} could see this and\\nlearn something from it.$","Text_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain":"We hope to see you again!$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisDefeat":"That can't be!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_DwayneDefeat":"Wow!\\nSurprised me!$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_WantYouToGetAmberExamined":"Ssh! Listen, I need to share a\\nsecret with someone.\\pI think that this chunk of AMBER\\ncontains POKéMON DNA!\\pIt would be a shattering scientific\\nbreakthrough if POKéMON could be\\lresurrected from it.\\pBut, my colleagues just ignore\\nwhat I have to say.\\pSo, I have a favor to ask!\\pI want you to get this examined at\\na POKéMON LAB somewhere.$","Route25_Text_WayneIntro":"You're going to see BILL?\\nFirst, we battle!$","CeruleanCity_House1_Text_TradeMoreBerryPowder":"This is fine BERRY POWDER indeed.\\nIt will make excellent medicine.\\pWould you like to trade more BERRY\\nPOWDER for something else?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_BeautifulPieceOfAmber":"There is a beautiful piece of\\nAMBER in a clear gold color.$","SSAnne_1F_Room7_Text_ThomasDefeat":"My, my friends…$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_ReceivedTownMapFromDaisy":"{PLAYER} received a TOWN MAP\\nfrom DAISY.$","CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_WeMakePrettyGoodTeam":"You beat MISTY!\\nSee, what'd I tell ya?\\pYou and me, kid, we make a pretty\\ndarn-good team!$","Text_CutTreeDown":"This tree looks like it can be CUT\\ndown!\\pWould you like to CUT it?$","Route22_Text_LateRivalPostBattle":"That loosened me up.\\nI'm ready for the POKéMON LEAGUE!\\p{PLAYER}, you need more practice.\\pBut hey, you know that!\\nI'm out of here. Smell ya!$","Text_MonSentToBoxInSomeonesPC":"{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\\nSomeone's PC.\\pIt was placed in \\nBOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$","PewterCity_Text_SprayingRepelToKeepWildMonsOut":"I'm spraying REPEL to keep wild\\nPOKéMON out of my garden!$","Route4_Text_CrissyDefeat":"After all I did to catch them!$","Route5_PokemonDayCare_Text_WhichMonShouldIRaise":"Which POKéMON should I raise?$","PewterCity_Museum_1F_Text_ShouldBeGratefulForLongLife":"I should be grateful for my long\\nlife.\\pNever did I think I would get to\\nsee the bones of a dragon!$","Text_DishesPlatesNeatlyLinedUp":"Dishes and plates are neatly\\nlined up.$","Route24_Text_YoudBecomeTopRocketLeader":"With your ability, you'd become\\na top leader in TEAM ROCKET.\\pCome on, think of the opportunity!\\nDon't let this chance go to waste.$","PokemonJournal_Text_SpecialFeatureBrock":"POKéMON JOURNAL\\pSpecial Feature: PEWTER GYM\\nLEADER BROCK!\\pBROCK rarely laughs, but is said to\\nbe unable to stop if he starts.$","Route24_Text_ReliPostBattle":"I did my best, so I've no regrets!$","ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons":"Well, now, I've had my coffee, and\\nthat's what I need to get going!\\pHm?\\nWhat is that red box you have?\\pAh, so you're working on your\\nPOKéDEX.\\pThen let me give you a word of\\nadvice.\\pWhenever you catch a POKéMON,\\nthe POKéDEX automatically updates\\lits data.\\p…You don't know how to catch\\na POKéMON?\\pI suppose I had better show you\\nthen!$","Route4_Text_CrissyIntro":"I came to MT. MOON in search of\\nmushroom POKéMON.$","Route6_Text_JeffDefeat":"This stinks…\\nI couldn't beat your challenge…$","VermilionCity_Text_BoardSeagallopTriPass":"Ah, you have a TRI-PASS.\\pWould you like to board\\na SEAGALLOP ferry?$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamIntro":"Wow! It's way bigger in here than\\nI thought!$","Route9_Text_CaitlinDefeat":"No!\\nYou're too much.$","SSAnne_2F_Room2_Text_BrooksDefeat":"Good match!\\nAh, I feel young again!$","Route3_Text_SallyRematchIntro":"That look you give me…\\nIt intrigues me so!$","Route6_NorthEntrance_Text_HiHowsItGoing":"Hi, how's it going?$","Route3_Text_JaniceDefeat":"You're mean!$","ViridianCity_Gym_Text_TakashiDefeat":"Ayah!$","PewterCity_House2_Text_MonsEasierCatchIfStatused":"A POKéMON becomes easier to \\ncatch if it has a status problem.\\pSleep, poison, burn, or paralysis…\\nThose are all effective.\\pBut catching POKéMON is never\\na sure thing!$","Trade_Text_DoYouHaveMonWantToTradeForMon":"Hi!\\nDo you have a {STR_VAR_1}?\\pWant to trade it for my\\n{STR_VAR_2}?$","MtMoon_1F_Text_MiriamDefeat":"Oh!\\nI lost it!$","CeruleanCity_Text_PokemonEncyclopediaAmusing":"You're making an encyclopedia on\\nPOKéMON? That sounds amusing.$","ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen":"Oh, okay then!$","Text_AdvertisingPoster":"It's an advertising poster about\\nall kinds of products.$","PalletTown_RivalsHouse_Text_CouldntLoveYouMore":"It couldn't possibly love you\\nany more than it does now.\\pYour POKéMON is happy beyond\\nwords.$","SSAnne_1F_Corridor_Text_PassengersAreRestless":"The passengers are restless from\\nthis long voyage.\\pYou might be challenged by the\\nmore bored ones!$","MtMoon_B2F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle":"If you find a fossil, give it to me\\nand scram!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_BrockHelpsExcavateFossils":"Hi, I'm excavating for fossils here\\nunder MT. MOON.\\pSometimes, BROCK of PEWTER GYM\\nlends me a hand.$","CableClub_Text_CantTradeEnigmaBerry":"A POKéMON holding the {STR_VAR_1}\\nBERRY can't be traded.$","Text_Computer":"It's all complicated words and\\nnumbers that make no sense…$","Route3_Text_ColtonIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","Route3_Text_ColtonRematchIntro":"Hey!\\nI saw you in VIRIDIAN FOREST!$","PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoToughenMyMon":"{RIVAL}: Okay! I'll make my\\nPOKéMON battle to toughen it up!\\p{PLAYER}! Gramps!\\nSmell you later!$","MtMoon_1F_Text_JoshPostBattle":"I came all the way down here to\\nshow off to girls.$","PalletTown_Text_OakDontGoOut":"OAK: Hey! Wait!\\nDon't go out!$","VermilionCity_Gym_Text_BailyIntro":"I'm a lightweight, but I'm good\\nwith electricity!\\pThat's why I joined this GYM.$","Route11_Text_DillonPostBattle":"What now?\\nLeave me alone!$","Route6_Text_IsabellePostBattle":"I want to get stronger.\\nWhat's your secret?$"};
